<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">Siempu Laibu</book>
  <para style="h">Siempu Laibu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Siempu Laibu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Siempu Laibu</para>
  <para style="mt">Siempu Laibu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hlanin kikhopna buh panin tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite hopi inlen tam bangin gen in: Note khatpo in Topa tungah ganhing biehna na lui ciengun bawnghon pan ahi sihle tuuhon pan hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua biehna khu bawnghon pana meihal biehna ahile, genbaang lo apa khat na pie ding hi; Topa mai-ah tua biehna nangma tanga ang kisanpieh thei nadingin kikhopna buh tunkotah na peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Meihal biehna ganhing lu tungah na khut na ngam ding a, tua khu nangma adingin thoidamna-in kisang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa mai-ah tua bawngtang kigo ding a, Aaron’ suon siempute in tua gansi peipi-in kikhopna buh tunkota om maitam ning li tengah the ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin meihal biehna ganhing a vun hawhin kisemnen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siempu Aaron’ tate in maitam tungah meitaw-in mei tungah sing bop ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aaron’ suon siempute in a sanente le a lutang le a thaute maitam’ mei sing tungah koi ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ahi vangin a sungkuote le a kengte tui tawh sawp sieng ding uhi. Tua ciengin siempu pa in meihal biehna dingin tua teng a unpi-in maitam tungah haltum ding hi. Tua khu Topa dinga a namtui meihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meihal biehna dinga na zah letsong pen tuu ahi a, keel ahi zongin a hon lah pan ahile genbaang lo apa khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa mai maitam sahlam pangah tua gan kigo ding a, Aaron’ suon siempute in maitam ning li tengah gansi the ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sate kisemnen ding a, siempu pa in maitam meitunga om sing tungah a lutang le a thaute tawh a koiton ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ahi vangin a sungkuo le a kengte tui tawh kisawp sieng ding hi. Tua ciengin siempu pa in a unpi-in pie-in maitam tungah haltum ding hi. Tuami khu meihal biehna ahi a, Topa in namtui a sah mei tawh kihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa tungah na lui uh biehna pen vate tawh meihal biehna ahile vakhu ahi sihle paalva khat zawzaw na teel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maitam-ah siempu pa peipi-in a lu hiatawng ding a, maitam tungah hal ding hi. Tua maitam pangah a si tasah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a tangkhai le a sunga om teng ladawhin maitam nisuona lam vutbuohna munah paikhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A hlakui gel panin balkeh ding a, hinanle a hiatawng sih ding hi. Tua ciengin siempu pa in mei tunga om sing tung, maitam tungah haltum ding hi; tua khu meihal biehna ahi a, Topa in namtui a sah mei tawh kihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi khatpo in Topa tungah an tawh biehna a lui leh a biehpiehna pen annel hi ding hi; biehna luipa in a biehpiehna tungah sathau buohin panamtui koi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aaron’ suon siempute kungah peipi ding hi. Ama in annel le sathau khutdim khat le panamtui zosie a lah zaw ciengin, siempu pa in melcina satanh dingin tua teng maitam tungah haltum ding hi. Tua khu Topa in namtui a sah mei tawh kihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale an tawh biehna dinga kizangmawh teng pen Aaron le a tapate-’a hi ding hi. Tua khu Topa tunga kipie meihal biehna lah panin a siengtho pen khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Meibunga ki-em an tawh biehna na lui ciengin tol saw lo sathau kinu mo, ahi sihle sathau kinu, tol sawlo mopheng hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na biehpiehna pen khangbeel dai sunga kikang an tawh biehna ahile tol saw lo, sathau kisaw annel hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua khu ehmal inlen a tungah sathau sung in; tua khu an tawh biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na biehna pen mo kanna sia khangbel sunga kikang an tawh biehna ahile sathau tawh kihal annel hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa kungah khat zawzaw tawh kibawl an tawh biehna na peipi ding hi; siempu pa kungah a kipeipi ciengin ama in maitam-ah peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siempu pa in an tawh biehna lah panin melcina satanh teng ladawhin maitam tungah hal ding hi. Tua khu Topa tunga a namtui mei tawh kihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An tawh biehna dinga a kizangmawh teng pen Aaron le a tate-a’ hi ding hi; tua khu Topa tunga meihal biehna lah panin a siengtho pen khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa tunga na tawi an tawh biehna pen tol sawlo hi ding hi. Azieh pen Topa kungah tol ahi a, khuoizu ahi zongin meihal biehna-in na hal sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa kungah anpal tawh biehna na tawi thei ding a, hizongle a gimnamtui dingin maitam tungah kipie lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An tawh biehna-ah Pasien tawh na kiciemna pen ci saw loin na om vawt sih ding a, na biehna zosie-ah ci na saw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa tungah gamasa biehna na lui leh gamasa biehna adingin a vuitha pana kila a kigawtvui, mei tawh a kihanggawte na pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tungah sathau sungin panamtui na buoh ding hi; tua khu an tawh biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Siempu pa in melcina satanh dingin a kigawtvui an pawlkhat le sathau le a panamtui zosie tawh a haltum ding hi; tua khu Topa tunga meihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na biehna pen thunuom biehna ahi a, bawnghon lah panin anu ahi sihle apa na tawi leh Topa mai-ah genbaang lo khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Biehna ganhing lutungah na khut ngamin kikhopna buh tunkotah na go ding hi; Aaron’ suon siempute in maitam kimvelah gansi the ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thunuom biehna panin Topa tungah mei tawh biehna dingin a gilpi tuom a thaute le a sungkuote kima om a thaute zosie tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a kawnga om a kal tegel le a kal tegel tunga om a thau, le a kal tegel tawh kilahtha ding ahi a sin tunga beh a tepkaite na pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Aaron’ suonte in mei tunga om sing tunga meihal biehnate tawh maitam tungah tuate hal ding uhi. Tua khu Topa dinga a gimnamtui mei tawh kihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa tunga na tawi thunuom biehna khu tuu le keel honte lah panin anu ahi a, apa ahi zongin a genbaang lo khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biehna dinga tuuno khat na tawi leh Topa mai-ah na peipi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />gan lutungah na khut na ngam ding hi. Kikhopna buh mai-ah tua gan kigo ding a, Aaron’ suonte in maitam kimvelah a si the ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa tungah meihal biehna dingin thunuom biehna panin a thaute, a ngumgu dong cienga ki-attan a meithau zosie le a gilpi tuom a thaute le a sungkuo kima om a thaute zosie tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a kawnga om a kal gela a thaute tawh, a kal gel tawh kilahtha ding ahi a sin tunga beh a tepkai pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu pa in Topa tungah mei tawh kihal an tawh biehna dingin maitam-ah tua teng hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na biehna khu keel khat ahile Topa mai-ah tua keel na peipi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuale a lutungah na khut na ngam ding hi; tua pen kikhopna buh mai-ah na go ding hi; tuale Aaron’ suonte in maitam kimvelah tua gansi the ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua lah panin Topa tungah meihal biehna dingin a gilpi tuom a thaute le a sungkuote’ tunga om a thau zosie tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a kawnga a kal gel le a thau tawh, a kal tegel tawh kilahtha ding ahi a sin tunga beh a tepkai na pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu pa in a gimnamtui dingin mei tawh kihal an tawh biehna dingin maitam tungah tuate hal ding hi. A thau zosie Topa -a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua khu na khang tawntung vua na tenna uh mun zosie-ah a kip tawntung thukham hi ding hi: Note in a thau ahi sihle a si kici poma na ne vawt sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite hopi inlen tam bangin gen in: Mi khatpo in bawl lo ding ahi Topa’ thupiehte khatpo sawm khol lopi-in a bawl khah ciengin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sathau siengtho kinusa siempu pa maw-in mipite tungah tua bangin mawna a tut leh, ama in mawna zieha biehna dingin Topa tungah genbaang lo bawngtangno khat pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Topa mai kikhopna buh tunkotah tua bawngtang peipi-in bawngtang lutungah a khut ngam ding hi; Topa mai-ah tua bawngtang kigo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sathau siengtho kinusa siempu pa in bawngtang’ si themkhat la-in kikhopna buh sungah a tawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siempu pa in tua bawngtang si sungah a khutme die-in, Topa mai mun siengtho dalna diel mai-ah a si kimkhat sagi vei the ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siempu pa in kikhopna buh sung Topa mai-a om gimnamtui halna maitam sakite tungah tua gansi nu ding a, ama in kikhopna buh tunkot mai-a om meihal biehna maitam bulah adang gansite zosie sung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in mawna zieha biehna bawngtang panin a thau zosie, a sungkuo a tuom a thau zosie le a sungkuo kimvela om a thau zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a kawnga a kal gel le tuate tunga om a thaute; le a kal gel tawh kilahtha ding a sin tunga beh a tepkai te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />thunuom biehna bawngtang panin tamte a kilah ma bangin ama in la ding a, siempu pa in meihal biehna maitam tungah tuate haltum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in bawngtang vun le a tel zosie, le a lu a kengte, a sungkuo le a eeh-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />bawngtang sa a omlai teng zosie- giephuol pulam mun siengtho khatah peipi-in sing kitaw mei tungah hal ding hi; tua pen vut kibuohna munah kihal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sawmhlim lopi-in Israel mihon buppi khiel kha-in a kikhawm mihonte in tua thu phawkha loin amate in bawl lo ding, ci-in Topa in a thupiehte khat po semin khielna a tut uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a bawlsa uh mawna a kithei ciengin mawna zieha biehna dingin a kikhawm mihonte in bawngtang khat peipi-in kikhopna buh mai-ah tawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihon upate in Topa mai, bawngtang lu tungah a khut a ngam ding vua, tuaci’n Topa mai-ah tua bawngtang kigo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sathau kinusa siempu pa in kikhopna buh sungah bawngtang si kimkhat peipi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />siempu pa in tua gansi sungah a khutme die-in, dalna puon mai Topa mai-ah gansi sagi vei the ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in kikhopna puonbuh sunga om Topa mai-a maitam kite tungah tua gansi kimkhat nu ding a, a sidang teng pen kikhopna buh tunkota om meihal biehna maitam bulah sung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in a thau zosie la dawhin maitam tungah haltum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mawna zieha biehna bawngtang a bawl bang lien ma-in tami bawngtang zong bawl ding hi; amate adingin siempu pa in thoidamna bawlpiehin a mawna uh thoidamin a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in giephuol pulamah bawngtang puo-in a masa bawngtang a hal ma bangin hal ding hi; tua khu mi honpite dingin mawna zieha biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa Pasien in bawl lo ding a ci ama’ thukhamte lahah khat popo, vaihawmpa khat in sawm lopi-in bawlkha-in mawna a tut ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a gamtatnasa mawna a kitheisah leh, ama in genbaang lo keeltang khat biehna-in peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in keeltang lu tungah a khut ngam ding a, Topa mai, meihal biehna gan kigawna munah tua keeltang go ding hi; tua khu mawna zieha biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siempu pa in a khutme tawh mawna zieha biehna dinga kizang gansi kimkhat la ding a, meihal biehna maitam kite nu-in, meihal biehna maitam bulah a omlai gansi zosie sung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thunuom biehna dinga kizang sathaute ma bangin, ama in a thau zosie maitam tungah a hal ding hi. Tua ahi ziehin siempu pa in a mawna ziehin ama ading thoidamna bawlpieh ding a, tua pa’ mawna kimaisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa’ thukhamte lahah bawl lo ding a kici thukhamte khatpopo na lah vuah mi maimai khat in sawm lopi-in bawlin a maw leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />na gamtatnasa khielna ang kithei ciengin na bawlsa mawna zieha na biehna dingin genbaang lo keel anu khat na tawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mawna zieha biehna gan lu tungah na khut na ngam ding a, tuale meihal biehna munah mawna zieha biehna kigo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Siempu pa in a khutme tawh gansi kimkhat la-in meihal biehna maitam kite nu ding a, a sidang teng maitam bulah sung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thunuom biehna dinga kigo gan thaute a kilah bangin ama in a thau la dawhin Topa dinga a gimnamtui dingin siempu pa in maitam tungah tuate hal ding hi. Tua bangin siempu pa in note tangin thoidamna bawlin na mawna uh kimaisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mawna zieha biehna dingin tuuno khat na tawi leh, tua tuuno genbaang lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mawna zieha biehna gan lu tungah na khut na ngam ding a, tuale meihal biehna gan kigawna munah mawna zieha biehna dingin tua gan kigo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Siempu pa in a khutme tawh mawna zieha biehna dinga kigo gansi la-in, meihal biehna maitam kite tungah nu ding a, a sidang teng pen maitam bulah sung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thunuom biehna panin tuu thau a kilah bangin a thau zosie na la ding a, siempu pa in Topa tunga meihal biehna tawh maitam tungah tuate hal ding hi. Tua bangin siempu pa in na bawlsa na mawnate tangin thoidamna hing bawlpiehin na mawna kimaisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note lahah khatpo teci pang dingin thukhen zumah ang kihlat ciengin na musa ahi sihle na theisa thute teci pang thei napi na gen nuom lo ziehin na maw leh dan na thuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi sihle note lahah khatpo in a sieng lo na khat po- a sieng lo gamsa sisa luong hitaleh a sieng lo innsa sisa luong hitaleh a sieng lo a awmtal ganhing - khatpo hitaleh thei kha lopi-in a khoikhah leh- abua na hi a, a maw na hi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi sihle nang in mi khat a niehsah thei a sieng lo na khat popo- a sien lo lam thei loin na khoikhah leh- tua khu na thei ciengin a maw na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi sihle note khatpo in ngaisutna hoi hitaleh, a sie hitaleh mite kiciem ngaina dan namkhat popo na kam tawh a thei loin na kiciem pah khah leh, na maw lam na thei ciengin tamte khat popo-ah a maw na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tamte khat penpen ah na maw lam na kiphaw ciengin tua na bawlsa mawna na pulah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale na bawlsa mawna dan dingin Topa tungah mawna zieha biehna-in ganhon panin tuuno anu khat ahi sihle keel anu khat na peipi ding hi; siempu pa in nang tangin na mawna zieha thoidamna ang bawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuuno khat na pieh zo sih leh na bawlsa mawna dan dingin Topa tungah vakhu ni ahi sihle paalva ni na peipi ding a, khat pen mawna zieha biehna le a khat pen meihal biehna ading hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siempu pa kungah tuate na peipi ding a, ama in mawna zieha biehna ding pen pie masa ding a, a ngawng botsan loin hialawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in maitam pangah mawna zieha biehna gansi kimkhat the ding a, maitam bulah a si dang teng hlawhkang ding hi; tua khu mawna zieha biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuale ama in ngaina kip om bangin meihal biehna dingin a nina pen pie ding hi. Tua bangin siempu pa in na bawlsa mawna ziehin nang tangin thoidamna hing bawlpieh ding a, na mawna kimaisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin vakhu ni ahi sihle paalva ni na pieh zo sih leh na bawlsa mawna zieha biehna dingin annel ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-sekhat mawna zieha biehna dingin na peipi ding hi; tua khu mawna zieha biehna ahi ziehin a tungah sathau buoh loin gimnamtui zong na koi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua pen siempu pa kungah na peipi ding a, siempu pa in phawna satanh dingin a sipdim khat hamin Topa kung meihal biehna tawh maitam tungah halton ding hi; tua khu mawna zieha biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua bangin siempu pa in tamte khat popo na bawlsa mawna ziehin thoidamna ang bawl pieh ding a, na mawna kimaisah ding hi. An tawh biehna bang ma-in a val teng siempu pa in tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note lahah mi khatpo in theikhol lopi-in thupieh a palsat a, a siengtho Topa’ vante khat popo-ah a maw khah ciengin, a mawna ziehin Topa tungah biehna dingin tuuhon sung panin genbaang lo tuutang khat tawi ding a, amanh ding pen biehinn shekel zangin ngun shekel tawh kikhel, amanh kise zaza hi ding hi; tua khu mawna zieha biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sil siengtho tunga na khielna ziehin lokiana na bawl ding a, se nga-suo- sekhat gawmbe-in siempu pa kungah na pie ding hi. Nang tangin siempu pa in mawna zieha biehna tuutang tawh thoidamna ang bawlpieh ding a, tuaci’n na mawna kimaisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa’ thupiehte in bawl dingin kilawm lo hi a ci na khat popo thei lona tawh note lahah khatpo in bawlkha-in na maw uleh mawna a tut zo na hi ta a, tuaci’n nang in mawna dan na thuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mawna zieha biehna dingin siempu pa kungah tuuhonte lahah genbaang lo tuutang khat, ahi sihle tua tawh amanh kikim khat na tawi ding hi; tuale siempu pa in theikhol lo-a na bawlkhah a khielna ziehin nangma tangin thoidamna ang bawlpieh ding a, tuaci’n na mawna kimaisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua khu mawna zieha biehna shi hi; nang pen Topa mai-ah khielna a bawl zo na hi ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note lahah mi khatpo in van kepsah thu-ah ahi zongin, vankhap thu-ah ahi zongin a vengpa solthopin a na a guhpieh a, ahi sihle a vengpa’ na a lahpieh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ahi sihle na mang khat a mu ciengin tua thu-ah zuouthu genin na a tampite lahah mi khat in a bawl thei na khat tawh kisai-in a man loin a kiciem a Topa’ thu a palsat leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />mawna a bawl zaw-in a khiel lam a kithei ciengin a guh vante hitale, a lahpieh vante hitale, ama kikemsah vante hitale, van mang a mukiate hitale,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a man loin ciemtui dawnna tawh a nga adang vante hitale, amanh za lokia ding a, senga-suo-sekhat piehbe ding hi. A mawna a kiphaw ni-in ama in vannei pa kungah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in mawna zieha biehna dingin Topa tungah tuuhonte lahah a genbaang lo tuutang khat, ahi sihle tua tawh amanh kikim khat peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siempu pa in Topa mai-ah ama tangin thoidamna bawlpieh ding a, tuaci’n mi khat’ bawl thei mawna khat popo-ah ama kimaisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate thupie inlen tam bangin gen in: Tam pen meihal biehna bawldan ahi hi. Meihal biehna pen tap tunga maitam tungah zan tungtawn zingmawng dongin om zing ding a, maitam tungah mei kikuongsah zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siempu pa in a saihadiel bawngbi sungten a ten zaw ciengin a saihadiel puontuol sil ding hi; tuale ama in maitam tunga a tumvam meihal biehna vutte luoh ding a, maitam gei-ah tuate koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin a puonte suo-in puon dangte silkia ding a, giephuol pulam a siengtho mun khatah a vutte puo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maitam tungah mei kikuongsah den ding hi; kimitsah ngai lo ding hi. Zingmawng sielin siempu pa in sing bopin a tungah meihal biehna koi ding a, thunuom biehna thau teng hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maitam tungah mei kikuongsah zing ding hi; kimitsah ngai lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam khu an tawh biehna bawldan ahi hi: Aaron’ tapate in maitam mai-a Topa mai-ah tuate pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in tuate lah panin annel sipdim khat le an tawh biehna sathau, biehna tunga om gimnamtui zosie tawh la-in ama phawna satanh khat pen Topa dinga a namtui dingin maitam tungah hal ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate in a mawhteng a ne ding uhi; tua pen a siengtho mun khatah tol saw loin kine ding hi; amate in kikhopna buh tuolah ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua pen tol tawh ki-em lo ding hi. Meihal biehna ei kipiehna sung panin amate tanh dingin ka pie zo hi; tua pen khielna zieha biehna le mawna zieha biehna bangin a siengtho pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A khang tawntung vua amau’ tanh ding ahi, Topa dinga mei hal biehnate panin Aaron suonte lahah pasal vannuoi in ne ding uhi; tuate tawh kisukha na khatpo a siengtho suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam pen ama sathau siengtho a kinu ni-in Aaron le a tapate in Topa kunga a peipi ding uh biehna ahi hi: A kibawl zing ahi an tawh biehna dingin annel ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-sekhat, alang zingmawngin, alang nitahin pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua pen khangbeldai tung khatah sathau tawh kibawl ding hi; a pheng phengin ki-emin a ki-ehmal an tawh biehna bangin limtahin halsa-in na peipi ding a, Topa tungah a gimnamtui dingin tuate na tawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aaron’ suonte lah panin ama zalaih dinga sathau kinusa siempu pa in tuate bawl ding hi; tam pen a unpi-in mei-a kihal ding Topa’ tanh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Siempu pa dinga kipie an tawh biehna vannuoi a unpi-in kihal ding hi; kine lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate hopi inlen tam bangin gen in: Tam khu mawna zieha biehna bawldan ahi hi. Meihal biehna gan kigawna mun Topa mai-ah mawna zieha biehna gan kigo ding hi; tua khu a siengtho pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mawna zieha biehna a luipieh siempu pa in tuate ne ding hi; kikhopna buhtuol sunga mun siengtho khatah tuate kine ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A sa a thamkha poma a siengtho suoh ding hi; tuale puon tungah a gansi a kithekhah ciengin nangma in a siengtho mun khatah tua gansi kithekhahna son teng na sawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sa huonna leibeel kitawkeh ding hi; ahi vangin taubeel-a kihuon ahile tui tawh silin kinawtval ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Siempute lah panin pasalte in tua biehna sate a ne thei ding uhi; tua khu a siengtho pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hizongle siengtho munah thoidamna bawl nadingin kikhopna buh sunga kipeipi gansi kilahna ahi mawna zieha biehna sa kine lo ding hi; mei tawh kihal ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khielna zieha biehna bawldan tam bang ahi a, tua khu a siengtho pen ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />amate in meihal biehna kigawna munah khielna zieha biehna go-in maitam pang zosie-ah a si kithe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Biehna-a kipie ding a thaute: a meithau, a sungkuo tuom a thau,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a kawnga om a kal gel le a tunga om a thau tawh, a kal gel tawh kilahtha ding ahi a sin tunga beh a tepkai tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa tungah meihal biehna dingin siempu pa in maitam tungah tuate hal ding hi; tua khu khielna zieha meihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siempute lah panin pasal poma in tua silpiehte ne ding hi; tua pen a siengtho mun khatah kine ding hi; tua khu a siengtho pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khielna zieha biehna le mawna zieha biehna a kibang ahi a, a bawldan zong kibang hi; thoidamna a bawlpieh siempu pa in tuate tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ma bangin mi khatpo’ meihal biehna a pie siempu pa in ama’ piehsa tua meihal biehna ganvun tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meibung sunga ki-em ahi an tawh biehna vannuoi le khangbeeldai ahi sihle khangbeel-a kikang zosie pen a pie siempu pa-a’ hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hizongle adang an tawh biehna vannuoi, sathau kihal ahi a, a gum tangpi ahi zongin Aaron’ suonte zosie in a kikimin hawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam pen mi khatpo in Topa tunga a pieh thei ding thunuom biehpiehna silpieh bawldan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungdamkona-a na pieh ahile tua lungdamkona biehna pen tol saw lo sathau tawh kihal moh, tol saw lo sathau tawh kizut mohpheng, le sathau tawh hoitaha kipawi annel mohte tawh na pieton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lungdamkona dingin thunuom biehpiehna tawh tol kisaw anlum mohte na biehna-in na peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami biehna khat ciet panin Topa tunga letsong dingin moh khat ta na pie ding hi; thunuom biehna gansi a the siempu pa in tua moh tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungdamkona-a thunuom biehna sa pen a kipieh ni ma-in kine pai ding hi; zingmawng dong khat zong na hen sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin na pieh biehpiehna pen kiciemna zieha biehna ahi sihle nop thu-a biehna ahile tua biehpiehna sa pen na pieh ni ma-in kine pai ding a, a zing ciengin khawnla teng kine ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ahi vangin a biehpiehna sa a omlai teng pen a ni thum ni-in kihaltum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni thum ni-in thunuoma kipie biehna sa khat popo a kineh leh tua pen kisang lo ding a, a pie pa tungah zong minphat kipie lo ding hi; tua khu a mudahuoi a suoh ding a, a ne mipa in ama’ khielna a puo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A bua na khat popo tawh a kisukha sa kine lo ding hi; mei tawh kihaltum ding hi. A sieng mi zosie in tua sa ne thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa dinga kipie thunuom biehpiehna sa pen a sientho lo laitahin a ne mite pen a mipite lah panin kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Note lahah mi khatpo in a bua na khat- mihing sien lona buana hitale ganhing sien lona hitale a buasa na khat popo hitale a tham a- tua zaw ciengin Topa dinga kipie thunuom biehpiehna sa a neh leh a mipite lah panin tua mipa kinotmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel mite kungah tam bangin ci in: Bawngtang thau ahi sihle tuu thau ahi sihle keel thaute na ne sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A mawh si ganhing ahi a, gamsate’ neh ganhing thaute ahi zongin nadangin kizang thei ding a, hizongle a sa na ne sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa tunga meihal silpieha kizang ganhing thau a ne poma a mipite lah panin kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na tenna mun khat popo-ah va ahi a, ganhing ahi zongin a si khat popo na ne sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sisan a ne mi poma a mipite lah panin kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel mite hopi inlen tam bangci in: Note lahah Topa tunga thunuom biehpiehna a pie ding mi khatpo in tua thunuom biehpiehna panin Topa kungah tua biehna peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangma’ khut tehteh tawh Topa ading meihal biehna na peipi ding hi; Topa mai-ah a kivei biehna-in a awmpheu a kivei thei nadingin a thau a awmpheu tawh na peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siempu pa in maitam tungah a thau hal ding a, ahi vangin a awmpheu pen Aaron le a tapate-a’ hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thunuoma na biehpiehna panun siempu pa tungah biehna-in a zietlam phei na pie ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aaron’ tapate lah panin thunuom biehna a pie mipa in ama’ tanh dingin a zietlam phei nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile a kivei biehna panin a awmpheu le a kipie a phei pen keima in Israel mite tung panin thunuoma a pieh uh biehpiehnate sung panin la dawhin, Israel mite tung panin kumtawna a tanh den dingun siempu Aaron le a tapate tungah ka pie zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tam pen Topa tunga kipie mei tawh kihal biehnate sung pan Topa’ siempu na sem dinga a kipeipi huna kipanin Aaron le a tapate tungah a kihawmpieh a tanh uh ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />tam teng pen Israel mite kung panin Topa in a khantan vua a kaih zing dingun amate sathau a nil ni-in thu pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tam teng pen meihal biehna, an tawh biehna, mawna zieha biehna, khielna zieha biehna, siempu suhdetna biehna, le thunuoma biehpiehna bawl dan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tam teng pen Sinai senel gamah Topa tunga biehnate a lui nadingun Israel mite a thupieh hun lai-a Topa in Sinai Muol tunga Moses a thupiehte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aaron le ama tawh a om a tapate, puonte, nu sathau, mawna zieha biehna bawngtang khat, tuutang ni, le tol saw lo anlum law khat la inlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuale kikhopna puonbuh lutna-ah Israel mihonte kaikhawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses in zong Topa’ thupieh bangin a bawl hi. Kikhopna puonbuh lutna-ah mihonte a kikhop ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses in mihonte kungah, “ Topa in tami khu sep dinga ei thupieh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Aaron le a tapate zawpi-in tui tawh amate a sil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in a puontungsil ama silsahin kawngga tawh gah a, a puontuolpi le a siempu puon zong a silsah hi. Tua ciengin ama in hoitaha kigan kawnggah tawh a siempu puon gah a, ama tungah a siempipuon tua tawh khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in ama tungah awmdal bulin a awmdal sungah Urim leh Thummim koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a lu tungah diel khimsah a, a diel tung a mai lamah, Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin kham kizepna, a siengtho kumpi lukhu a khusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in nu sathau la-in biehbuh le a sunga om van zosie nu-in tuate a siensuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in maitam tungah tuate kimkhat sagi vei the-in maitam le vanzah zosie, le kuong le a tunna zong nu-in tuate a siensuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in Aaron’ lu tungah sathau kimkhat buohsuhin a siensuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin Moses in Aaron’ tapate zawpi-in ama in amate puontungsilte silsah a, kawnggate tawh gahin a lu tung vuah lukhute a khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in mawna zieha biehna bawngtang peipi a, Aaron le a tapate in mawna zieha biehna bawngtang lu tungah a khut uh ngamin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua bawngtang kigo hi. Moses in gansi la a, a khutme tawh maitam ki zosie tungah a si kimkhat nu-in maitam siensuo a, tua ciengin maitam bulah a si sungsuh hi. Tua bangin ama in maitam adingin thoidamna bawlin a siensuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moses in a sungkuo kimvela om a thau zosie le a sin tunga beh a tepkaite, le a kal gela a thau tawh la-in maitam tungah tuate a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin ama in bawngtang le a vun, a tel le a eeh teng giephuol pulamah mei tawh a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in meihal biehna dingin tuutang a peipi hi. Aaron le a tapate in tuutang’ lu tungah a khut uh ngamin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tua tuu kigo hi. Moses in maitam pang zosie si tawh the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuutang kisemnen a, Moses in a lu le a sanente le a thaukhalte mei tawh a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A sungkuo le a kengte tui tawh a kisawp zaw ciengin Moses in maitam tungah tuutang a luongpi-in a hal hi; tua khu Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin Topa tunga gimnamtui meihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in suhdetna tuutang ahi tuutang a nina pen a peipi hi. Aaron le a tapate in tuutang’ lu tungah a khutuh ngamin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuutang kigo hi. Moses in a si kimkhat la-in Aaron’ zietlam biltep, a zietlam khutpi, le a zietlam kepi nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aaron’ tapate a kipeipi zaw ciengin Moses in a zietlam biltep, a zietlam khutpite le a zietlam kepite tungah gansi kimkhat the a, a omlai gansi teng pen Moses in maitam pang zosie-ah the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in a thau, a meithau, a sungkuote tunga om a thau zosie, a sin tunga beh a tepkai, le a kal gel le a thau tawh le a zietlam phei a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in Topa mai-a tol saw lo anlum law sung panin tol saw lo moh khat, sathau kisaw anlum moh khat, le mopheng khat la a, a thau tung le a zietlam phei tungah tuate koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in Aaron le a tapate’ khut sungah tam teng zosie koi-in Topa mai-ah a kivei biehna-in a vei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in a khut sung panun tuate la-in meihal biehna tawh maitam tungah a hal hi. Tami khu siempu suhdetna biehna ahi a, Topa dinga a gimnamtui meihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in a awmpheu la-in Topa mai-ah a kivei biehna-in a vei a, tuami khu Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin siempu suhdetna biehna tuutang pana Moses’ tanh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in nu sathau kimkhat le maitam tunga om gansi kimkhat la a, Aaron le ama’ puon tung, a tapate le a puon tung vuah zong a the hi. Tam bangin ama in Aaron le a puonte, le a tapate le a puonte uzong a siensuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Moses in Aaron le a tapate kungah, “Kikhopna puonbuh tunkotah a sa huon unlen, ‘Aaron le a tapate in tua sa a ne ding uhi,’ ci-in kei thu ei kipieh bangin, siempu suhdetna biehna law sunga anlum tawh tua munah ne unlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tuale a sa le anlum a omlai teng pen mei tawh na haltum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Siempu pa dingin suhdetna ni a cin masang, kikhopna puonbuh pulamah ni sagi sung na pusuoh sih ding uhi. Azieh pen note ang kisuhdet nading ni sagi sawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuni-a kibawlsa bangin note adinga thoidamna a kibawl nading Topa in thu pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh lutna-ah ni sagi sung, sun le zanin na om den ding vua, na si lo nadingun Topa’ thupiehte na zui ding uhi; azieh pen tua bang dingin keima tungah thu ei kipie zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate in Topa in Moses tung tawna a thupieh zosie a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in a ni giet ni-in Aaron le a tapate le Israel upate hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Aaron kungah, “Mawna zieha biehna dingin genbaang lo bawngtang ano khat le meihal biehna dingin tuutang khat la inlen, Topa mai-ah tuate pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mite kungah, ‘Mawna zieha biehna dingin keeltang khat la in; meihal biehna dingin genbaang lo kumkhat a pha bawngno khat le tuuno khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />le Topa mai-ah thunuoma biehpiehna dingin bawngtang khat le tuutang khat la in; tuale sathau kisaw an tawh biehna pie in. Bangzieh ahei cile tuni-in na kung vuah Pasien ang kilang ding hi,’ ci-in gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh mai-ah Moses’ thupieh teng a peipi uhi; tuale a nai-ah mihon zosie pei-in Topa mai-ah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale Moses in, ”Tami pen note tungah Topa’ vanglietna ang kilaa thei nadinga na bawl ding vua Topa ang thupieh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Aaron kungah, “Maitam lam neh inlen na mawna zieha biehna le na meihal biehna pie in. Topa’ thupieh bangin nangma ading le mite adingin thoidamna bawl in; tuale mite adingin biehpiehna bawl inlen amate dingin thoidamna bawlpieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aaron in maitam lam nehin ama adingin mawna zieha biehna bawngno go hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aaron’ tapate in ama kungah si a tawi vua, ama in tua si sungah a khutme dawn phumin maitam’ kite tungah nu hi; tua site a omlai teng maitam bulah a sungsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hizongle Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin ama in maitam tungah mawna zieha biehna panin a thau, a kal gel le a sin tunga beh a tepkaite a hal hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuale a sa le a vun teng zong giephuol pulamah a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin meihal biehna gan a go hi. Aaron tapate in ama a si a pie vua, tua a si pen maitam pang zosie-ah the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in meihal biehna a nennenin a lutang tawh ama kungah tawi-in maitam tungah a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in a sungkuo le a kengte sawp a, tuate maitam tungah meihal biehna tawh a halton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abanah ama in mite’ biehna a pie a, mite adingin zong mawna zieha biehna keel a pie hi. Ama in tua keel go a, a masa-a bangin mawna zieha biehna dingin a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in meihal biehna peipi a, bawldan ngaina a om bangin biehpiehna a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zingmawnga meihal biehna banah an tawh biehna a peipi a, tuate a sipdim khat la-in maitam tungah mei tawh a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in mite adingin thunuoma biehna dingin bawngtang le tuutang go hi. Aaron’ tapate in ama kungah a si a peipi vua, maitam pang zosie-ah ama in tua si the a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />bawngtang le tuutang thau-a meithau, a sungkuo tuom a thau, a kal gel le tuate tunga a tuom a thaute, le a sin tunga beh a tepkai teng a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amasa-in a awmpheu tungah a thau a koi vua, maitam tungah tua a thaute kihal hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Moses’ thupiehsa bangin Aaron in a awmpheute le a zietlam pheite, Topa mai-ah a kivei biehna-in a vei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aaron in mite lamah a khut lamto-in amate thupha a pie hi; ama in mawna zieha biehna, meihal biehna, le thunuom biehnate a lui zaw ciengin a peisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh sungah Moses le Aaron a lut vua, ang pusuo cieng gelin mipite thupha pie a, tuaci’n Topa’ minthanna mi zosie tungah kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa tung panin mei pusuohin maitam tunga meihal biehna le a thaute a katum hi; tuale mi zosie in tua mei a mu ciengin awngin a mai tuolkun uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Aaron’ tapate Nadab le Abihu in a panamtui beel tuoh gel la-in tuate sungah meikam koi-in a tungah panamtui a koi uhi; Topa in tua banga a thupieh vawt lopi-in ama gel in a mai-ah a sieng lo mei a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale Topa’ opna panin meikuong pusuohin Topa mai-ah ama gel katumin a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Aaron kungah, “Tami khu Topa’ gen nop thu ahi a, ama in ‘Ka gei-a omte tungtawnin ka sienthona ka lah ding a, mi zosiete mai-ah ei kiminthangsah ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi. Tuale Aaron a sip dide hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses in Aaron’ pano ahi Uzziel’ tapate Mishael le Elzaphan hlan a, a ama gel kungah, “Hing pei un, mun siengtho mai panin giephuol pulam mun khatah na sanggamte puodawh ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses’ sawl bangin ama gel a pei vua, giephuol pulamah a puon tungsil gel tawh zawngin a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses in Aaron le a tapate Eleazar le Ithamar kungah, “Na lu tung vua na sam bahkaisah sih gel inlen, na puon gel botkeh sih un, tua banga na bawl uleh na si ding vua, tuami lungthahna in mihon zosie vatmai ding hi; hinanle na sanggamte Israel innkuon buppi ahile Topa’ sawl meikuong ziehin thum le tau-in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh lutna pulam kal sih gel in, na kal gel leh na si ding uhi; azieh pen no gel tungah Topa’ nu sathau a om hi,” a ci hi. Moses’ gen bangin ama gel a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale Topa in Aaron kungah tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang na hi a, na tapate ahi zongin kikhopna puonbuh sunga na lut ciengin na si lo nadingun lenggazu ahi a, khamthei zu ahi zongin na dawn sih ding uhi; tua khu na khang tawntung vua a om zing ding ngaina kip ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mun siengtho le taangpi mun, a bua le a sieng na khen ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuale Topa in Moses tung tawna a gensa thukham zosie Israel mite na hil ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses in Aaron le a omlai a tapate, Eleazar le Ithamar a hopi hi: Mei tawh a kihal Topa’ biehnate sung panin a val lai an tawh biehna la unlen, maitam gei-ah tol saw loin ne un, bang zieh ahei cile tua khu a siengtho pen ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tua pen Topa tunga meihal biehnate sung panin nangma le na tapate’ kaih ahi ziehin mun siengtho khatah na ne ding uhi; azieh pen tua bang dinga kei thu ei kipie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin a kivei a awmpheu le a kilamto a phei pen nangma le na tapate, le na tanute in zong mun siengtho khatpo-ah na ne thei ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile tuate pen Israel mite in thunuoma a biehpiehna uh pana nangma le na tapate adinga a kisesa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in a kilamto a phei le a kivei a awmpheu, mei tawh a kihal biehna thaute tawh, Topa mai-ah a kivei biehna-in a tawi ding uhi; Topa’ thupiehsa bangin nangma le na tapate in tuate na kaih zing ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in mawna zieha biehna keel thu khu a kan leh tua keel pen na kihaltum dawh ta hi! A omlai Aaron’ tapate, Eleazar le Ithamar tungah ama lungthah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Bang dingin mun siengtho sungah mawna zieha biehna na neh lo uh ahei? Azieh pen tua khu a siengtho pen ahi a, amau’ tangin Topa mai-ah thoidamna bawl in mihonte’ khielna na lahdawh thei nadingun Pasien in na tung vuah tuate ang pie zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Munsiengtho sung lamah tua gansi kipeipi lo hi. Ka thupiehsa bangin tua khu munsiengtho sunga na neh ding vua kilawm ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aaron in Moses hopi a, “En in, tuni-in amate in Topa mai-ah a mawna uh zieha biehna le a meihal biehnate uh a pie zo ta uhi. Hizongle kei tungah tua bang nate ang tung zo hi! Tuni-in mawna zieha biehna a ne kha hi poma leng, Topa a thukim mawh diei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moses in tua thu a zah bepin a thukim hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron hopi-in tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite hopi-in tam bangin gen un: Tam teng pen leitunga om ganhingte lahah na neh thei ding uh ganhingte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kecin a kaa, ehnel a hlai ganhing poma- tua bangte na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin ehnel-hlaite lah pan hitale kecin-kaate lah pan hitale tamte na ne sih ding uhi: Kalaoh in ehnel a hlai vangin a kecin kaa lo hi; tua khu note dingin sieng lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sakih ganhing in ehnel a hlai vangin a kecin kaa lo hi; tua khu note dingin sieng lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bilpi in annel a hlai vangin, a kecin kaa lo hi; tua khu note dingin sieng lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Voh a kecin a kaa vangin, ehnel hlai lo hi; tua khu note dingin sieng lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam bang sate ne loin a sisate zong na tham sih ding uhi; tuate pen note dingin sieng lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tui sunga om zosiete lah panin tam teng na ne thei ding uhi. Tuipi sung hitale lui sung hitale, hla le lip a neite zosie na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuipi ahi sihle lui sunga om hla le lip a nei lo, tui sunga a hontat ganhingte le tui sunga om adang hinna a nei ganhing zosiete lahah khat popo pen
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />note dingin a kidahhuoi hi den ding hi. Tuate’ sa na ne sih ding vua, a sisate zong a kidahhuoi-in na ngaisun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tui sunga om hla le lip nei lo zosie note dingin a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vate lah panin tam teng pen a kidahhuoi-in na ngaisun ding uhi. Tuate kine lo ding hi; tua a kidahhuoite: muvanlai, langta, luimu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />mumeikaa, mukhau namcin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />va-ah namcin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ostrich vapi, pengpeleuh, vatawt, musi namcin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />keising, tuimu, simbu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />gam vatawt, tui vatawt , musane,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />gun vapi, tuiva kengsau namcin, le huitun le bahte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kengli tawh lam a pei, hla a nei ganhing zosie note dingin a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin hla a nei, kengli tawh a pei ganhingte lahah a kitom nadinga a kepheng tungah a kizom keng tampi a neite na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuate lah panin na neh thei dingte uh: kauphe kitom nam zosie, kauphe zol nam zosie, khuomkhit nam zosie, le khuombai nam zosie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin keng li nei-in hla a nei ganhing dangte zosie note dingin a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam teng ziehin a sieng lo na hi ding uhi; a sisa ganhing a tham poma nitah masang a sieng lo na hi ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tua gan sisa khat popo lahah a sa themkhat a puo poma in a puonte sawp sieng ding a, nitah masang a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A kecin kaa nanle ehnel a hlai lo ganhing zosie note dingin a sieng lo ahi hi; tuate khatpo a tham khate a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kengli tawh lam a pei ganhingte lah panin a kephang tawh lam a pei zosie note dingin a sieng lo ahi hi; tuate lahah a si khatpo a thamkhate nitah masang a sieng lo hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />gan sisa a puo pa in a puonte sawp siengin nitah masang a sieng lo hi ding hi; tua teng pen note dingin a sieng lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Leitunga a bawhva ganhingte lahah tam teng pen note dingin a sieng lo ahi hi: bui, zusa, tangpi namcin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />taldep, tang, thangkhit, senel thangkhit, talmam te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A hontat ganhing zosie lah panin note dingin tam teng pen a sieng lo hi ding hi; tuate khatpo a si ciengin a tham poma nitah masang a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuate a si ciengin a tuhna nate, sing vanzah, puon, savun, la-ip le na khatpo-a kizang vanzah khatpo hitale a sieng lo hi ding hi; tua teng pen tui sungah kidie ding a, nitah masang a sieng lo hi dinghi; tua zaw ciengin a sieng hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Leibeel sungah tuate khatpo a kieh leh, tua sunga om zosie a sieng lo hi ding a, tua leibeel na tawkeh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua beel sunga a om a kine thei an khatpo tungah tua bang tui khatpo a tuh leh a sieng lo hi ding hi; tua bang beel sunga om a kidawn thei tui poma a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ganhing sisa themkhat a tuhna poma a sieng lo hi ding hi; meibung lungthu hitale, tap tung hitale kitawkeh ding hi; tua teng pen a sieng lo hi a, note dingin a sieng loin a om suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuinah ahi sihle tuibem sunga omte a sieng hi ding a, tua ganhing tawh a kithukha na khatpo pen a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua dinga a kituomkoi khaici tungah tua gan sisa themkhat a tuh leh, tua khaici pen a sieng ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />ahi vangin tui sungah khaici kidie-in tua a sisate themkhat tua tunga a tuh leh, tua pen note dingin a sieng lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na neh thei ding uh ganhing khat a si leh tua gan sisa a tham poma pen nitah masang a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ganhing sa a ne poma in a puonte sawp ding a, nitah masang a sieng lo hi ding hi; tuale ganhing sisa a luonghawm a puote in a puon a sawp ding vua, nitah masang a sieng lo hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Leitunga a hontat ganhing poma a kidahhuoi ahi hi; tuate kine lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A awm-a kithol poma, le kengli-a vah poma, ahi sihle keng hau, leitunga hontat ganhing zosie na ne sih ding uhi; azieh pen tuate a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A hontat ganhing khatpo tawh noma le noma a kidahhuoi-in na om sih ding uhi; tuate tawh noma le noma na kiniehsah sih ding vua, na kiniehsah uleh a sieng lo na suoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Azieh pen keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi; tua ahi ziehin kei a siengtho ka hi ziehin noma le noma kisiengsah un. Leitunga a bawhva ganhing khatpo tawh noma le noma kiniehsah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note’ Pasien ahi dingin Egypt gam pana nohaw ang peitopi Topa ka hi hi; kei a siengtho ka hi ma bangin no zong na siengtho ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tam teng pen vasate, tui sunga gamta hinna a nei ganhing zosie le leitunga a bawhva hinna a nei ganhing zosie tawh kisai ngainate ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />tuaci’n hinna a nei ganhingte, a sieng le a sieng lo, a sa neh thei ding le a sa neh thei lo dingte na khen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite kungah tam bangin gen in, a ci hi: Numei khat gai-in ta pasal khat a nei leh a nin nei lai ma bangin ni sagi sung tua nu a sieng lo hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a ni giet ni-in a tapa a tep kitan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A siluonna panin a kisiensuo nading hun pen nisawm thum le ni thum sung hi ding hi; a kisiensuona ni a cin masangin a siengtho na khatpopo tham thei lo ding a, mun siengtho sungah zong lut thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in ta numei khat a nei leh a nin nei hun lai ma bangin nipikal ni sung a sieng lo hi ding hi; a siluonna a kisiensuo nading hun pen ni sawm guh le ni guh sung hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kisiensuona ni a cin zaw ciengin, tua nu in a tapa ading ahi a, a tanu ading ahi zongin kikhopna puonbuh lutna siempu pa kungah meihal biehna dingin kum khat a pha tuuno khat, le khielna biehna dingin paalva khat ahi sihle vakhu khat peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Topa mai-ah tuate peipi-in tua nu adingin thoidamna bawlpieh ding hi; tua ciengin a siluonna panin tua nu a sieng hi ding hi. Tam pen tanu hitale tapa hitale a nei nu adingin zui ding ngaina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua nu in tuuno a pieh zawh sih leh paalva ni ahi sihle vakhu ni tawi ding a, khat pen meihal biehna le adang khat pen khielna biehna hi ding hi; tuale siempu pa in tua nu adingin thoidamna bawlpieh ding a, ama a sieng hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron kungah tam bangci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi khat in ama’ tahsa vun tungah a cibaw khat hitale, hima khat hitale cikang khat hitale a nei a, a tahsa vun tungah phah natna suoh thei ding dan a a op leh, siempu Aaron ahi sihle ama’ tapa siempute khat popo kungah kipeipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siempu pa in a ci tunga hima vel ding a, a hima munah a multe kangin a hima zong a ci tunga a vun sangin a thuh tum zaw-a a kimu leh, tua pen phah natna ahi hi; siempu pa in a vel zaw ciengin ama a sieng loin kise hi, ci-in a phuongzah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama’ ci tunga a vun sungah a hima kang napi a vun sangin a thuh tum lo zaw-in a kimu a, tua sunga a multe a kan sih leh siempu pa in ama ni sagi sung zia a tangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siempu pa in a ni sagi ni-in vel ding a, a hima a ngaingai a na hi a, a ci tunga a kizel sih leh siempu pa in ni sagi sung ma zia tangsahkia lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siempu pa in a ni sagi ni-in velkia ding a, a hima khipin a kizel nawn sih leh ama sieng hi, ci-in siempu pa in a phuongzah ding hi; tua pen hima maimai ahi bo hi; tuale ama in a puonte sawp sieng ding a, tua ciengin a sieng hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in a sientho nadingin siempu pa kungah a kilaa zaw ciengin a hima pen a vun sung tenga a kizelmang tah leh siempu pa kungah ama kilahkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siempu pa in cienvel ding a, a vun sung tengah a hima a kizelmang zo tah leh siempu pa in ama sieng lo hi, ci-in phuongzah ding hi; tua khu phah natna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi khat in phah natna a vei leh siempu pa kungah kipeipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siempu pa in velcien ding a, a vun sungah a mul a kangsah cibaw a kang a op a, tua a cibaw sungah a tel sosuong a op leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua khu a cilah vun sunga a om a dam thei nawn lo phah natna ahi hi. Siempu pa in ama sieng lo hi, ci-in phuongzah ding hi; ama a sieng lo ahi ziehin zia kitang sah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin siempu pa muna danah tua natna in a vun a phuhkhe a, a lutang panin a kephang dongin a tuommang zo tah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />siempu pa in cienvel ding a, a natna in a ci tung zosie a tuommang tah leh, tua natna tawh kisai-in ama sieng hi, ci-in a phuongzah ding hi; a ci tung zosie a kansah zo tah ziehin ama a sieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin a ci tungah a matha ang opkia leh ama a sieng lo hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />siempu pa in a ma tha pen cienvelin ama sieng lo hi, ci-in phuongzah ding hi. Tua khu phah natna ahi ziehin tua a ma tha pen a sieng lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin a ma tha ang kankia leh siempupa kungah ama pei ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />siempu pa in ama velin, a natna a kang a suo zo tah leh siempu pa in natna veipa pen sieng hi, ci-in phuongzah ding hi. Ama pen a sieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi khat’ tahsa vun tungah a damsa uilut khat a op a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tua uilut munah cibaw a kang khat ahi sihle a san kang khat a op leh tua pen siempu pa kungah kilah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siempu pa in velcienna nei ding a, a vun sangin a thuh zaw-in a multe a kang a suo leh siempu pa in ama sieng lo hi, ci-in a phuongzah ding hi; tua khu phah natna ahi a, uilut pana ang phuhkhe ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hizongle siempu pa in cienvelin tua tunga a multe a kan sih a, a vun sangin thuh tumzaw loin a dup leh siempu pa in ni sagi sung ama zia tangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A vun sunga a kizel tah leh siempu pa in ama sieng lo hi, ci-in a phuongzah ding hi; tua khu phah natna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua a cikang pen mun khatah om denin a kizel sih leh tua khu uilut hima pawn ahi bo hi; siempu pa in ama sieng hi, ci-in a phuongzah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi sihle tahsa in a vun tungah meikahma khat a nei a, tua meikahma a tha mun pen a san kang ahi sihle a kang ang suo leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tua pen siempu pa in a cienvel ding hi. Tua cikang tunga a om a multe kangin a vun sangin a thuhzawh leh tua khu phah natna ahi hi; tua pen meikahna pana ang phuhkhe ahi a, siempu pa in ama sieng lo hi, ci-in phuongzah ding hi. Tua khu phah natna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin siempu pa in velin cikang tunga om a mul a kan sih a, a vun sangin thuh tumzaw loin a dup leh, siempu pa in ama ni sagi sung zia tangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A ni sagi ni-in siempu pa in ama velcien ding hi; a vun sunga a kizel leh siempu pa in ama sieng lo hi, ci-in phuongzah ding hi. Tami khu phah natna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin mun khatah tua cikang om denin a vun sungah kizel loin a dup leh, tua khu meikahna pana cibaw ahi bo a, siempu pa in ama sieng hi, ci-in phuongzah ding hi. Azieh pen tua khu meikahna pana hima pawn ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pasal ahi sihle numei in a lutang tung ahi sihle a kha-ah natna khatpo a nei ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />siempu pa in tua natna cienvel ding hi. Tua natna pen a vun sanga a thuhzaw-in a kimu a, tua sunga om a multe engdangin a ngat zitzet leh siempu pa in ama sieng lo hi, ci-in a phuongzah ding hi; tua khu cithah ahi a, luphah ahi sihle khaphah natna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siempu pa in tua cithah natna velin a vun sangin a thuhzaw lo bangin kimu-in tua sungah mulvom a op sih leh siempu pa in ni sagi sung cithah natna tawh tua pa khumcipin zia tangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A ni sagi ni-in siempu pa in cithah natna vel ding hi; tua cithah a kilaw sih a, a sungah a mul engdang loin, a vun sangin a cithah a thuh lo zaw banga a kimu leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />ama in a sam heukieu ding a, hizongle a cithah mun teng heu lo ding hi. Siempu pa in a cithah natna tawh ama ni sagi khumbe lai-in zia tangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A ni sagi ni-in siempu pa in tua cithah vel ding hi; a cithah in a vun sung law loin a vun sangin a thuh lozaw-a a kimu leh, siempu pa in ama sieng hi, ci-in a phuongzah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama sieng hi, ci-in a kiphuongzah zaw ciengin a cithah in a vun sung a zel leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />siempu pa in ama vel ding hi. A vun sungah a cithah a kizel zo tah leh siempu pa in mul eng sui kul nawn lo hi; ama a sieng lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahi vangin a mittang sungah cithah a noptuom zo tah a, a sungah a mulvom po-in a cithah a dam zo tah leh ama a sieng ahi hi; siempu pa in ama sieng hi, ci-in a phuongzah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pasal ahi sihle numei in a tahsa vun tungah cikangte a nei leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />siempu pa in velin a kandang leh tua khu a vun a phukeh hima ahi hi; ama a sieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mi khatpo a lu tunga a sam pulin a lu a tol vangin ama a sieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A talpang le a ankhawibaw’ sam a pul a, a pang a tawl vangin ama a sieng ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahi vangin a lutol tungah ahi sihle a pangtawl tungah a san kang hima a op leh, tua khu a lutol tung ahi sihle a pangtawl tunga a pusuoh phah natna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Siempu pa in ama velcien ding hi; tua ahima baw pen a lutol tungah hitale a pangtawl tungah hitale, tahsa vun tunga phah natna op dan banga a kangsan ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />ama phah natna vei ahi a, ama a sieng lo ahi hi. Siempu pa in ama sieng lo hi, ci-in a phuongzah ding hi; a lutang tungah a natna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Phah natna vei pa in puonsiete sil ding a, a lu tunga a samte bawhkaisah lo ding hi; ama in a nephu humin, ‘Sienglo, Sienglo,” ci-in kiko ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Natna a nei laisie ama a sienglo hi ding hi; ama a sienglo ahi hi. Ama guoh teng ding hi; ama’ tenna pen giephuol pulam hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Puonsil tawh kisai tam bang ahi hi: Tua puon tungah phah natna a op ciengin samul puon hitale saihadiel puon hitale,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />adung le avai-a kigan saihadiel puon, samul puon, savun, le savun tawh kibawl na khat popo tungah a tuh ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />puon tungah tua hima a engin hitale a sanin hitale adung le avai-a kigan puon, savun, le savun tawh kibawl na khat popo tungah a tuh leh, tua khu phah natna ahi a, siempu pa kungah kilah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Siempu pa in tua natna vel ding a, natna baang vante ni sagi sung tuomkoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ama in a ni sagi ni-in a natna vel ding hi. Tua natna pen adung le avai-a kigan puon, savun, le bang khat popo-a kizang savun tunga a kizel zo tah leh, tami khu mi a law thei phah natna ahi hi; tua khu a sieng lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tua natna pen adung le avai-a kigan puon, samul, saihadiel, savun khat popo tunga a tuh leh ama in tua puonte mei tawh hal ding hi, azieh pen tua khu mi a law thei phah natna ahi hi; tua khu mei sungah kihal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Siempu pa in velin, tua natna pen adung le avai-a kigan puon tung le savun khat popo tunga a kizel sih leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />siempu pa in natna a banna tuami van sawp dingin amate thupie ding a, ama in adang ni sagi sung ma tua van a tuomkoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Natna a banna van a kisawp zaw ciengin siempu pa in vel ding hi. Tua natna a kilaw sih nanle a natna mun a mel a kikhel sih leh, tua khu a sieng lo ahi hi; a sung lamah ahi sihle a pu lamah tua phah natna cikang a op leh, tua khu mei-ah na hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Siempu pa in a natna a kisawp zaw ciengin velin tua natna a dup leh, ama in adung le avai-a kigan puon tung pan hitale savun khat popo tung pan hitale tua cikang opna mun teng ehbal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tua natna adung le avai-a kigan puon tung hitale savun tawh kibawl van khatpo tungah hitale ang opkia leh, tua khu a kilaw thei ahi hi; tua natna banna teng mei tawh na hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Hizongle adung le avai-a kigan puon, le savun khatpo a kisawp sieng zaw ciengin natna a ven leh a ni veina kisawp ding a, tua puon a sieng hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tam khu samul puon ahi a, saihadiel puon le adung le avai-a kigan puon, le savun van khat popo tungah ahi zongin a baang phah natna tawh kisai a sieng le a sieng lo khinkhai thei nading ngaina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam pen a kisiensuo ni-in miphah pa zui ding ngaina hi ding hi: Siempu pa kungah ama kipeipi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />giephuol pulamah siempu pa pei-in velcienna khat bawl ding hi. Tua phah natna veipa a natna a dam leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />siempu pa in a kisiensuo pa dingin vata hinglai a sieng ni, taamtah sing, a ausan puon le hyssop la dingin amate a sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siempu pa in leibeel sung khat a kikoi tuisieng tungah vata khat tha dingin thupie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in tua vata hinglai pen taamtah sing le a ausan puon le hyssop-te tawh lahtha-in, tuisieng tunga kithat vata si’ sungah tuate le vata hinglai pen die ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in phah natna pana kisiengsah ding pa tungah sagi vei the ding hi; tua ciengin ama sieng hi, ci-in phuongzahin tua vata hinglai pen gamlahah hla ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kisiensuo ding pa in a puonsilte sawpsiengin a sam heu ding a, tui sungah kisilin ama a sieng hi ding hi. Tua zaw ciengin giephuol ah ama pei ding a, ahi vangin puonbuh pulamah ni sagi sung om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ni sagi ni-in a mul zosie heu sieng ding hi: A lu, a khamul, a mitkhu mul le a mul zosie heu ding hi; tua ciengin a puonsilte sawpin tui sungah kisil ding a, ama a sieng hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ni giet ni-in ama in genbaang lo tuuno apa ni, le genbaang lo kum khat a pha tuuno khat, le an tawh biehna sathau kisawsa annel ephah khat’ sesawm-suo- sethum le sathau log khat la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama a siensuo siempu pa in a kisiensuo ding pa pen tam teng tawh, kikhopna buh lutna Topa mai-ah koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siempu pa in tuuno apa khat la-in sathau log khat tawh khielna zieha biehna-in pie ding a, Topa mai-ah a kivei biehna-in tuate lamto ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in mawna zieha biehna le meihal biehna gan kigawna mun siengtho-ah tua tuuno go ding hi; azieh pen mawna zieha biehna bangin khielna zieha biehna pen siempu pa-a’ ahi hi; tua khu a siengtho pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siempu pa in khielna zieha biehna si themkhat la ding a, a kisuonsuo ding pa’ a zietlam biltep tung, a zietlam khutpi tung, le a zietlam kepi tungah tua si nu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siempu pa in sathau log khat panin themkhat la-in a veilam khut phangah sung ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a veilam khut sunga om sathau sungah a zietlam khutme die-in a khutme tawh sathau themkhat Topa mai-ah sagi vei the ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Siempu pa in a khut sunga a omlai sathau themkhat, a kisiensuo ding pa’ a zietlam biltep, a zietlam khutpi, le a zietlam kepi nu-in khielna zieha gansi tungah koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siempu pa’ khut sunga sathau omlai teng pen a kisiensuo ding pa’ lu tungah nupieh ding hi. Tua ciengin siempu pa in Topa mai-ah ama adingin thoidamna bawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A sien lona panin a kisiensuo ding pa ading thoidamna bawl nadingin siempu pa in mawna zieha biehna pie ding hi. Tua ciengin ama in meihal biehna go ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuale siempu pa in maitam tungah meihal biehna le an tawh biehna te koi ding hi. Tua bangin ama adingin siempu pa in thoidamna bawlin ama a sieng hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanle ama a zawn ziehin tampi a pieh zawh sih leh ama ading thoidamna bawl nadingin ama in a kivei ding, khielna zieha biehna dingin tuuno khat, an tawh biehna dingin sathau kisaw annel ephah’ sesawm-suo- sekhat le sathau log khat pie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />vakhu ni ahi sihle paalva ni zong a pieh zawh bangbangin pie ding a, khat pen mawna zieha biehna hi ding a, a khat pen meihal biehna hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ni giet ni-in ama in Topa mai, kikhopna puonbuh lutna, siempu pa kungah ama’ kisiensuo nadingin tuate tawi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tuale siempu pa in khielna zieha biehna tuuno le sathau log khat la ding a, a Topa mai-ah a kivei biehna-in tuate lamto ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siempu pa in khielna zieha biehna tuuno go ding a, tua khielna zieha biehna sasi themkhat la-in a kisiensuo pa’ a zietlam biltep, a zietlam khutpi, le a zietlam kepi nu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Siempu pa in a veilam khutkuoh sungah sathau themkhat sung ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a veilam khut sunga om sathau themkhat, Topa mai-ah a zietlam khutme tawh sagi vei the ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Siempu pa in a khut sunga om sathau themkhat, a kisiensuo ding pa’ a biltep, a zietlam khutpi, le a zietlam kepite tungah khielna zieha biehna gan si kikoina munah nu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A khut sunga sathau omlai teng pen siempu pa in a kisiensuo ding mipa adingin Topa mai-ah thoidamna bawl nadingin a lu tungah nupieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in vakhu ahi sihle paalva a piehzo zawzaw pie-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />khat pen mawna zieha biehna ding, a khat pen meihal biehna dingin an tawh biehnate tawh piehtha ding hi; tuale siempu pa in a kisiensuo pa dingin Topa mai-ah thoidamna bawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tami khu phah natna a vei, siensuo nading biehna a lui zo lo mipa dinga ngaina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron hopi-in tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Keima in na luo ding vua kang pieh Canaan gamah nang pei uh ciengin na tenna mun inn khatah phah natna kang tunsah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />inn nei pa pei-in siempu pa kungah, “Ka inn sungah natna nam khat a om tawh kibang sa ing,” ci-in gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Siempu pa in tua inn sunga om van zosie a sieng lo a kici lo nadingin, tua natna kan dingin siempu pa a pei masangin tua inn a hawma a op nadingin thupie ding hi; tua zaw ciengin inn van dingin siempu pa pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in a natna vel ding hi; inn kawm tung tengah natna omin, a engsim le a sansim ahi a, tua pen kawm maitang sangin a thuh zawh tuoh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />inn sung panin inn mai kotah siempu pa pusuohin ni sagi sung kot khahcip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A ni sagi ni-in siempu pa peikia-in cienvel ding hi; kawm tung tengah tua natna a kizel leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />siempu pa in tua natna banna suongte khawhdawhin khuo pulam nin buohna mun khat a pai dawh dingin thupie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama in inn sunglam kizutna zosie hiet siengsahin, a khawdawh uh a kizutna themneng zosie khuo pulam nin buohna mun khatah buo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate in suong dangte la-in tua suongte munah a koi ding vua, a zutna dang khat la-in tua inn zut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama in suongte ladawhin a inn hiet siengin a zut sieng zaw ciengin tua inn sungah natna a tunkia leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />siempu pa pei-in cienvel ding hi; inn sung tengah tua natna a kizel zo tah leh, tua khu inn sunga om a zauhuoi phah natna ahi hi; tua pen a sieng lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ama in tua inn a suong a sing le a kizutna zosie phelsah ding a, khuo pulam nin buohna mun khatah a puosah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua inn a kikha hun sunga a lut mi zosie nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />tua inn sunga a lum mi zosie in a puonte a sawp sieng ding uhi; tua inn sunga anne zosie in zong a puonte a sawp sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Siempu pa pei-in a cienvel a, tua inn a kizut zaw ciengin natna a kizel nawn sih leh siempu pa in tua inn sieng hi, ci-in phuongzah ding hi; tua natna dam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tua inn siensuo nadingin ama in vata ni, taamtah sing le a ausan khau le hyssop na tawh lahtha-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />vatate lahah khat pen tua tuisieng tunga leibeel sungah that ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />tua vata hinglai tawh taamtah sing, hyssop sing le a ausan khaute lahtha-in, tua tenga kigo vata’ si tawh tuisieng sungah die-in tua inn sagi vei the ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tua bangin ama in vata’ si tawh, tuisieng tawh, vata hinglai tawh, taamtah sing, hyssop sing le a ausan puon tawh a inn siengthosah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />tuale ama in khuopi pulam gamlahah tua vata hinglai hla ding hi; tuaci’n ama in tua inn adingin thoidamna bawlpieh ding a, tua inn a sieng hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tami khu phah natna khatpo tawh kisai sep ding ngaina ahi hi: Cithah ading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />puonte le inn sunga om phah natnate ading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />cibaw ahi sihle hima ahi sihle cikhangte ading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />bang hun ciengin sieng lo a, bang hun ciengin sieng ahei ci-in khinkhai thei nading ahi hi. Tami khu phah natna tawh kisai bawldan ngaina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron hopi-in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite kungah tam bangin gen in: Pasal khatpo a pumpi panin a neitah tui a pei ciengin tua tui in ama a niehsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A neitah tui zieha a sienlona tambang ahi hi: A pumpi panin a neitah tui a pei a, a pumpi panin a neitah tui pei a khawl zongin ama adingin sienlona ma hi veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A neitah tui pei pa’ lupna zosie a sieng lo hi ding hi; tuale ama’ tona sil zosie a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama’ lupna a thamkha poma in a puonte sawp siengin tui sungah kisil ding a, nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A neitah tui pei pa khat’ tona tunga a to kha zosie in a puonsilte uh a sawp sieng ding vua, amate zong tui sungah kisilin nitah dong a sieng lo hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua a neitah tui a pei pa a thamkha mi poma in a puonsilte sawp sieng ding a, tui sungah kisilin nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A neitah tui pei pa in a sieng mite tungah cil a siet leh amate in a puonsilte uh sawp siengin tui sungah a kisil ding vua, tuaci’n nitah dongin a sieng lo ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A neitah tui pei pa’ tuonna sakolphaw khatpo zong a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama’ nei-a a om na khat popo a thamkha mi zosie pen nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding a, tua bang nate a puo kha zosie in a puonsilte sawp sieng ding a, tui sungah kisilin nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A neitah tui pei pa in tui sungah a khut sil lopi-in a thamkhah mi zosie in a puonsilte uh a sawp sieng ding vua, tui sungah kisilin nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A neitah tui pei pa in a thamkhah lei tawh a kibawl vanzah poma kitawkeh ding hi; sing tawh a kibawl vanzahte tui sungah kisawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A neitah tui pei pa khat a neitah tui luonna a sien ciengin, a sien nadingin ni sagi dong simto ding hi; ama in a puonte sawp ding a, tuisieng sungah kisilin ama a sieng hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ni giet ni-in ama in vakhu ahi sihle paalva ni la-in kikhopna puonbuh lutna Topa mai-ah pei-in siempu pa kungah tuate pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siempu pa in tuate, khat mawna biehna ding le adang khat meihal biehna-in pie ding hi; tuale siempu pa in a neitah peina ziehin Topa mai-ah thoidamna bawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi khatpo in bawtui a te leh tui sungah kisil ding a, nitah dongin ama a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua bawtui tuhna puon ahi sihle savun zosie tui tawh kisawp ding a, nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasal khat numei khat tawh lumtonin a bawtui a te leh a ni gelin tui sungah a kisil ding vua, nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Numei khat in a pum tung pana a hun mana a nei a nin a pei ciengin, ni sagi sung a niehin om ding a, ama a thamkha popo nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nin nei sungin a lupna na zosie a sieng lo hi ding hi; ama’ tona sil zosie zong a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama’ lupna a thamkha poma in a puonte sawp sieng ding a, tui sungah kisilin nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama’ tona a thamkha poma in a puonte sawp sieng ding a, tui sungah kisilin nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />mi khatpo in ama’ lupna ahi sihle a tona na khatpo a thamkhah leh nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pasal khatpo tua nu tawh lumtonin ama’ sienlona ama tunga a tun leh ni sagi sung ama a sieng lo hi ding hi; tuale ama’ lup khahna lupna zosie a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Numei khat in a nin nei hun sung hi lopi-in ni tampi sung a si pei ahi a, a nin pei hun valin nin a nei leh a nin nei ni hun sung teng ama a sieng lo hi ding hi; a nin pei hun sung bang ma-in ama a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A nin nei hun sung tungtawna a lupna zosie a nin nei sunga a lupna tawh kibangin kingaisun ding hi; a nin nei sungin a sieng lo ahi ma bangin a tona zosie zong a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tam nate a tham kha poma a sieng lo hi ding a, a puonte sawpin tui sungah kisil ding a, nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A nin neina panin a sien leh ni sagi dong simto ding a, tua zaw ciengin ama a sieng hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A ni giet ni-in tua nu in gam vakhu ni ahi sihle paalva ni la-in, kikhopna puonbuh lutna siempu pa kungah peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Siempu pa in khat pen mawna biehna dingin pie ding a, a khat pen meihal biehna dingin pie ding hi; a nin neina hang tawh a sien lona ziehin siempu pa in Topa mai-ah tua nu adingin thoidamna bawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua bangin a laizang vua a om ka biehbuh a buasah ziehun, a sien lona uh sungah a si lo nadingun a sien lona panun Israel mite na tuomkoi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tami khu a neitah tui peite dinga bawldan ngaina ahi hi: Bawtui a te zieha a sieng lo a suoh mipa ading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />tua nu a nin nei huna thazawm hun sung ading, a neitah tui a luong numei le pasal a koimapo ading, le a sieng lo numei tawh a lumton mipa ading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aaron’ tapa nite in Topa mai nehin a silaw zaw cieng gelin Topa in Moses hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah gen hi: Thuciemna singkuong tunga hepina topha mai, dalna puon sunglam siengtho munah a nop hunhuna ang mawh pei lo nadingin na sanggampa Aaron kungah gen in. Ang mawh pei leh a si ding hi; azieh pen tua hepina topha tunga meiilum lahah keima ka kilaa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mun siengtho sungah Aaron ang lut dan ding tam bang ahi hi: Mawna zieha biehna dingin bawngtangno khat le meihal biehna dingin tuutang khat tawh ang lut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a siengtho saihadiel puontungsil sil ding a, a pumpi tungah saihadiel bawngbi tengin saihadiel kawngga tawh kigah ding a, saihadiel dielpi khim ding hi. Tam teng pen a siengtho puonte ahi hi. Tui sungah ama kipumsil ding a, tua ciengin tua puonte sil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Israel mihonte kung panin mawna zieha biehna dingin keeltang ni le meihal biehna dingin tuutang ni la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aaron in amama adingin mawna zieha biehna-in bawngtang khat pie-in, ama le a innkuonpite adingin thoidamna bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in keel ni la-in kikhopna puonbuh lutna-ah koi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aaron in tua keel tegel tungah ai sanin, khat pen Topa ading, adang khat pen Azazel ading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa ading aai a tuhna keel pen Aaron in peipi-in mawna zieha biehna-in pie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahi vangin Azazel dinga ai a tuhna keel pen gamlahah Azazel kungah sawl dawhin thoidamna a kibawl thei nadingin Topa mai-ah a hingin kipeipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aaron in amama adingin mawna zieha biehna-in bawngtang khat pie-in, ama le a innkuonpite adingin thoidamna bawlpieh ding hi; amama adingin zong mawna zieha biehna-in bawngtang go ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in Topa mai maitam panin meikam a dim meiluona kuong khat le, a kigawtvui gimnamtui khutdim ni la-in dalna puon sungah peipi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />gimnamtui khu in thuciemna singkuong tunga om hepina topha a tuom thei nadingin Topa mai-a mei tungah tua gimnamtui koi ding hi. Tua banga a bawl sih leh ama si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in bawngtang si kimkhat la-in, a khutme tawh hepina topha a mailam tungah the ding a, hepina topha mai-ah a khutme tawh sagi vei the ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in mite adingin mawna zieha biehna keel go-in dalna puon sungah a si peipi ding a, bawngsi a the ma bangin a si the-in hepina topha tung le hepina topha mai-ah the ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in tua bangin Israel mite’ sienlona, amau’ thupalsatna, le amau’ mawna teng zosie ziehin mun siengtho adingin thoidamna bawl ding a, amau’ sienlona laizanga amate tawh a om den kikhopna puonbuh adingin tam bang ma-in bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mun siengtho sungah thoidamna bawl dingin a lut huna kipanin ama ading, a innkuonpite ading, le a kikhawm Israel mihon zosie adingin thoidamna a bawl zaw a pusuokia masangsie, kikhopna puonbuh sungah koima om thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa mai-a a om maitam-ah pei-in maitam siensuona bawl ding a, bawngtang si le keelsi kimkhat la-in maitam kimvela om a kite nu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in tua tungah a si kimkhat a khutme tawh sagi vei the-in siensuo ding a, Israel mite’ sienlona panin siengthosah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in siengtho mun le kikhopna puonbuh le maitamte adingin thoidamna a bawlpieh zaw ciengin keel hinglai peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Aaron in a hinglai keel lu tungah a khutgel ngam ding a, Israel mite’ khielna zosie, amau’ thupalsatnate zosie, amau’ mawnate zosie le amau’ khielna zosie thumpieh ding a, keel lu tungah tua teng suonin tuami nasep sem dinga a kisesa mi khatin gamlahah tua keel heumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua keel in a tungah amau’ khielna zosie puo-in gammang tulahah pei ding hi; tuale gampa lahah a keel kihla ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin kikhopna puonbuh sungah lut ding a, mun siengtho a lut masah lai-a a sil saihadiel puonte sutdawhin tua munah nuasie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in mun siengtho khatah tui tawh kipumsilin a puonte sil ding hi; tua ciengin pusuohin a meihal biehna le mite’ meihal biehna pie-in, ama ading le mite adingin thoidamna bawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in maitam tungah mawna zieha biehna thau haltum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Azazel kunga keel a hlapa in a puonte sawpin tui sungah kipumsil ding a, tua zaw ciengin giephuol zuon thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siengtho munah thoidamna dinga a si kipeipi ahi mawna zieha biehna bawngtang le khielna zieha biehna keelte pen giephuol pulamah kipeipi ding hi; a vunte, a telte le a ehte mei tawh kihaltum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuate a halpa in a puonte sawpin tui sungah kipumsil ding a, tua zaw ciengin giephuol lam zuon thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tami khu note dingin tawntung thukham hi ding hi: Hla sagina, tua hla a ni sawm ni-in, no le no kidehin tuolsung mi hile na lah vua ang pem khuolmi hile bangma na sem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Azieh pen tuami ni-in na sien nadingun thoidamna kibawl ding hi; Topa mai-ah na mawna zosie panun na sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tam pen note dinga a bukim tawlngahna Sabbath ahi a, no le no na kideh ding uhi; tua khu tawntung thukham ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A pa tangin siempu dingin sathau kinu-in a kisudet siempu pa in a siengtho saihadiel puon silin thoidamna bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in mun siengtho adingin thoidamna bawl ding a, kikhopna puonbuh le maitam adingin zong thoidamna bawlin, siempute ading le a kikhawm mihonte zosie adingin zong thoidamna bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tami khu kum khatin khatvei amau’ mawna vannuoi ziehin Israel mite adingin thoidamna bawl nadinga a kizang den ding ngaina kip ahi hi. Topa’ thupiehsa bangin Moses in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses a hopi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate le Israel mite zosie tungah tam bangin gen in: Tam pen Topa ang thupiehsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel innkuonte khatpo in bawngtang hile, tuuno hile, keel hile, giephuol sungah ahi a, giephuol pulamah ahi zongin a gaw a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa’ biehbuh mai-a Topa kungah biehna khat ahi dingin kikhopna puonbuh lutna-ah tuate a peipi sih leh, ama in tua sisan a luongsah khielna a lukhuh ding hi; ama in si luongsah zo ahi ziehin a mite lah panin ama kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam pen Israel mite in gamlaha a pieh uh amau’ biehnate a peipi thei nading uh, kikhopna puonbuh lutna-a Topa tung ahi, siempu pa tungah tuate a peipi thei nading ule thunuom biehna-in Topa kungah biehpiehnate a tawi thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siempu pa in kikhopna puonbuh lutna, Topa’ maitam tungah a si the-in Topa tunga a gimnamtui dingin a thau hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in a mawpi uh, a bieh uh keel-dawite adingin kithoina a bawl nawn sih ding uhi. Tami khu amate dingin a khantan vua ngaina kip khat hi zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate kungah tam bangin na genbe ding hi: Israel innkuonte lah panin hile amate lahah a teng pemtate kung panin hile, meihal biehna ahi sihle biehpiehna a pie mi khatpo in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa tunga pieh dingin kikhopna puonbuh lutna-a ang peipi sih leh, a mite lah panin tua pa kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel innkuonte lah pan hile amate lahah a teng pemtate lah pan hile, mi khat in si khatpo a neh leh, tuami si a ne mipa tungah ka maigum ding a, mite lah panin ama ka hemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen si sungah tahsa hinna a om hi; maitam tungah note dingin thoidamna bawl nadingin na tung vuah tua si kang pie zo hi; bang ding ahei cile si pen mi khat a hinna thei nadinga thoidamna bawlna ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel mite tungah tam bangin ka gen zo hi: Note lahah koima in si ne lo ding a, note lahah a teng pemtate khatpo in zong tuami si ne lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mi khatpo in hile, note lahah ang teng pemtate lahah khatpo in hile, a gamvana-ah a kine thei gamsa khat ahi sihle a kine thei vata khat a mat leh a si hlawhin leivui tawh vuatha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinna a nei ganhing zosie adingin a si khu a hinna ahi hi; tua ziehin keima in Israel mite tungah ka gen zo hi: Ganhing khatpo’ si na ne sih ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile ganhing zosie’ hinna pen a si ahi hi; tua si a ne poma kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A mawh si hile gamsate in a na ehmalsa ganhingte hile a ne mi poma, tuolsung mi hile pemtate hile a puonte sawpin tui sungah kisil ding a, nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding hi; tua ciengin a sieng hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in a puon uh sawp loin ahi a, kisil loin ahi zongin a op uleh amau’ khielna a lukhuh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite kungah tam bangin gen in: Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na tenna uh Egypt leitanga a teng mite’ gamtat bangin na gamta sih ding vua, kang peipi nading Canaan leitanga a teng mite’ gamtat bangin zong na gamta sih ding uhi. A thukhamte uzong na zui sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka biehna ngaina kipte na tang ding vua, ka thukhamte na zui ding uhi: Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka thukhamte le ka biehna ngaina kipte na zui ding uhi; tua banga a zui pa khu a hing ding hi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note koima in luppi dingin na kinaipi uh tanaute khatpo na nai sih ding uhi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na nu na luppi ziehin na pa na mindaisah sih ding hi; ama na nu ahi ziehin na luppi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na pa zi’ na luppi sih ding hi; tua khu na pa’ mindai nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuol sunga suoh ahi a, khuol gama suoh ahi zongin, na sanggamnu, na pa’ tanu, ahi sihle na nu’ tanute na luppi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na tapa’ tanu ahi sihle na tanu’ tanute na luppi sih ding hi, azieh pen amau’ maizumna pen nangma’ maizumna veve ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na pa pana a pieng, na pa’ zi tanu na luppi sih ding hi. Azieh pen ama na sanggam nu ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na pa’ sanggamnu na luppi sih ding hi; ama nu pen na pa’ si le sa ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na nu’ sanggamnu na luppi sih ding hi, azieh pen ama na nu’ cilesa ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na pa’ sanggampa na luppi sih ding hi; tua pen ama’ zi na nai sih ding hi, a ci nopna ahi hi; ama pen na innlah nu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na monu na luppi sih ding hi: Ama na tapa’ zi ahi hi; ama na luppi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na sanggampa’ zi na luppi sih ding hi; tua khu na sanggampa’ mindaina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Numei khat le a tanu na luppi sih ding a, luppi dingin tua numei’ tapa’ tanu ahi sihle a tanu’ tanute na la sih ding hi.; amate nangma’ cilesa ahi bo vua, tua banga gamtatna pen gamtat sietna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sanggamnu suon dingin na nuphal nu zi-in na la sih ding a, a sanggamnu hin lai pima-in ama na luppi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Numei khat a nin pei-in a sien lo laitahin luppi dingin na neh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na sanggampa’ zi na luppi sih ding a, tua nu tawh na kibuasah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kithoi nadingun Molech tungah na suon na hlahte khatpo na pie sih ding a, Pasien’ min na daisah sih ding hi. Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Numei khat tawh na lupton bangin pasal khat tawh na lumton sih ding hi; tua khu sil kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ganhing khatpo tawh maw-in tua tawh na kibuasah sih ding a, numei khatpo in zong ganhing khatpo mawpi dingin ama’ pumpi a pie sih ding hi; tua khu piensuolna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam teng khatpo tawh noma le noma na kibuasah sih un, azieh pen na masang vua ka nawdawh minamte in tam bang gamtatna zosie tawh amau le amau a kibuasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua bangin leitang a bua a suoh hi; tuale khielna ziehin tua leitang dan ka pie ding a, leitang in ama tunga a teng mite a luokhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanle na lah vua a teng tuolsung mi hile pemtate hile ka thukhamte le ka biehna ngaina kipte na zui ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />(azieh pen na masang vua a om tuolsung mite in a kidahhuoi tam nate zosie a sem vua, tuaci’n leitang a bua ahi ta hi);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tua bang ahi sihle ama na buasah ziehun na masang vua minamte a luohkhiet bangin leitang in note ang luokhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Azieh pen tam kidahhuoi nate a sem poma a mite lah panin kinotmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n na mai vua kizang tam a kidahhuoi khatpo na sepkhah lo nading ule tuate tawh na kibuasah lo nadingun kang thuhil zui un: Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mihonte zosie tam bangin hopi in: Note na siengtho ding uhi, azieh pen keima Topa na Pasien uh ka siengtho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note khat ciet in na nu le na pa zatahin ka Sabbath-te na tang ding uhi. Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Milimte lamah kihei sih unlen, noma dingin a kisungtawm pasien-te bawl sih un: Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa tungah thunuom biehna na pieh ciengun, note tangin tuate a kisan thei nadingin tam bang danin pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na pieh ni ma uh ahi sihle a zing ciengin kine ding hi; a ni thum ni donga a kine lo a val poma mei tawh kihal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ni thum ni-in a kineh lai leh tua pen a kidahhuoi ahi hi; tua pen kisang lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua a ne mi zosie in mawna dan thuoh ding uhi. Azieh pen amate in Topa tunga sil siengtho pen a niehsah zo ahi ta vua, tua bang mi poma a mite sung panin kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na leitang tung panun an na lah ciengun na lo gei dongun na la sih ding vua, na ansangh uzong na khawm sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lengga lo vuah lenggate na lo sieng sih ding vua, tuola a kie lenggate zong na tung sih ding uhi; mizawngte le pemtate adingin tuate na nuasiepieh ding uhi: Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na guta sih ding uhi; a man loin zong na gamta sih ding vua, khatlekhat na kisol sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A man loin ka min tawh na kiciem sih ding vua, na Pasien uh’ min na daisah sih ding uhi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na vengte na sol sih ding uhi; na guta sih ding uhi; noma dingin zingmawng cieng dongin nasem khat’ thaman na kem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bilbingte hamsiet loin mittawte mai-ah a suikhah ding nate na koi sih ding uhi; na Pasien na zatah ding uhi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A dih lo thukhenna na nei sih ding uhi; mizawngte deisah tuom loin miliente na mai-et tuom sih ding uhi: thuman tawh na vengte thu na khen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na mite lah vuah mi gensiete bangin suhva tova sih unlen, na vengte’ sisan tawh phattuom na sui sih ding uhi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lungtang sung vuah na tanaute khatpo na muda sih ding uhi; na vengte thu na hil ding uhi, tua hi sihle ama’ khielna na puo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na mite uh khatpo tungah phu la loin na kilungsimpuoh sih ding vua, noma na ki-it bangun na vengte na it ding uhi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thukhamte na zui ding uhi. Namdangte tawh na gante uh ta na neisah sih ding uhi; na lo vuah khaici nam ni na vaw sih ding uhi; khau nam ni tawh a kigan puon zong na sil sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pasal khat in midang khat tawh kikhamsa hi napi a kitan nai lo ahi sihle suotahna kipie nai lo sila nu khat a luppi leh thukanna kinei ding hi. Tua nu suohta nai lo ahi ziehin amate kithat lo ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />hizongle tua pa in amama adingin khielna zieha biehna dingin tuutang khat, kikhopna puonbuh lutna Topa kungah peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Siempu pa in ama’ bawlsa mawna dingin khielna biehna tuutang tawh Topa mai-ah ama adingin thoidamna bawlpieh ding hi; tuale a bawlsa a mawna kimaisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khum gamah lutin neh dingin singkung namcin na suon ciengun tua singgate a kikham bangin na ngaisun ding uhi; note dingin tua singgate kum thum sung kikham ding a, kine lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A kum lina ciengin a ga zosie lungdamna biehna-in Topa tungah kituomkoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin a kum ngana ciengin note dinga tuate ang ga semsem nadingin a gate na ne thei ding uhi: Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na khatpopo a si tawh na neton sih ding uhi. Mailam thugen kholna ahi sihle aisanna na nei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na lu kimvelin na sam uh heusieng loin na khamul mongte uzong na tan sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Misite adingin na citung uh liemsah loin na ci tung vuah ciemtena khatpo na sun sih ding uhi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gam sung pahtatna suohin gamtat sietnate tawh a kidim lo nadingin pahtatna tawh na tanute na daisah sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka Sabbath-te na tang ding vua, ka mun siengtho na zatah ding uhi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Dawilawm neite le bumtawite lamah kihei sih un; amate tawh a kibuasah dingin amate sui sih un: Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khanghamte mai-ah dingin putehte’ maitang na zatah ding uhi; na Pasien uh na zatah ding uhi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na gam sung vuah pemta khat tawh na tenton ciengun tua pemta pa na gawt sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na tentonpi uh pemta khat pen note dingin tuolsung mi hi ding hi; noma bangin pemtate na it ding uhi, azieh pen no zong Egypt gamah pemta na hi ngai uh: Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A sau tena, a gih tena, ahi sihle a nem tenate-ah a man lo zangin mi na sol sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tawikhaina a man, tawisuong a man, ephah a man, hin a mante na nei ding uhi: Egypt gam pana note ang peipi keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka thukham zosie le ka biehna ngaina kipte zosie zui-in tuate na tang ding uhi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite kungah tam bangin genbe lai in: Israel mite khatpo hile Israel gam sunga a teng pemtate hile, Molech tunga a tate khatpo a pie mipa kithat ding hi; gam sung mite in suong tawh seplia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Molech tungah a tate pie a, ka mun siengtho buasahin ka min siengtho a daisah ziehin, kei mama in amate ka maisiet ding a, mite lah panin amate ka hemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Molech tungah a tate a pieh ciengun gamsung mite in amate a mu lo kipangin tua pa a tha sih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />kei mama in amate le a innkuonpite ka maisiet ding a, Molech tunga a pahtatna vuah amate a zui mi zosie a mite lah panun ka hemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dawilawm neite le bumtawite lamah mi khatpo kihei-in tuate thu a dawh leh, keima in tua pa ka maisiet ding a, mite lah panin ama ka hemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin no le no ki-ap unlen siengtho un. Azieh pen keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thukhamte zui unlen tuate tang un; Keima Topa ka hi hi; keima in note kang siengthosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A pa ahi sihle a nu a samsie poma kithat ding hi; a pa ahi sihle a nu a samsiet zo tah ziehun amate tungah amau’ sisan tu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasal khat in a vengpa’ zi tawh ang a kikawm leh, angkawm nu le awngkawm pa a ni gelin kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pa’ zi tawh a lumton mipa in a pa’ min daisah ahi hi; a ni gel in kithat ding hi; ama gel’ sisan luonna khu ama gel tung ma-ah tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A monu tawh pasal khat a lupton leh a nipi-in ama gel kithat ding hi; ama gel a piensuol ahi vua, ama gel’ sisan luonna ama gel tung ma-ah tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasal khat in numei a luppi ma bangin pasal khat a luppi leh a ni gelin a kidahhuoi khat bawl ahi uhi; ama gel kithat ding hi; ama gel’ sisan luonna pen ama gel ma tungah tu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasal khat in a zi dingin numei khat a lah a, a nu tawh zong a lahton leh tua khu gamtatsietna ahi hi; na lah vuah gamtatsietna a ven thei nadingin tua pa le ama gel mei tawh kihaltum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pasal khat in ganhing khat a luppi leh ama kithat ding hi; a ganhing zong na that ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Numei khat in ganhing khatpo nehin tua ganhing a luppi leh tua numei le ganhing na that ding uhi; amate kithat ding a, a sisan uh pen amau’ tung ma-ah tu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasal khat in ama’ sanggamnu, ahi sihle a pa’ tanu, ahi sihle a nu’ tanu la-in tua nu a luppi a, tua nu in zong tua pa a luppi leh tua khu muolphona ahi a, a mite’ muna pan amate kihemkhie ding hi; ama in a sanggamnu a luppi zo tah leh ama in dan a thuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasal khat, nin nei numei khat tawh lumtonin tua nu a mawpi leh tua pa in tua nu’ si luonna a dawhsah a suoh a, tua nu in zong tua pa’ si luonna a dawhsah ma ahi hi; a mite sung panun a nipi-in ama gel kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na nu’ sanggamnu ahi sihle na pa’ sanggamnu na luppi sih ding uhi; tua khu ama’ tanaute tawh mawna ahi ziehin a amau’ mawna amate ma in khu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pasal khat in a pa’ sanggampa’ zi tawh a lupton leh ama in a pa’ sanggampa a mindaisah ahi hi; ama gel in mawna dan a thuoh ding uhi; hlah le suon nei loin a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pasal khat in a sanggampa’ zi a lah leh tua pen siengtho lona ahi hi; a sanggampa a mindaisah ahi hi; ama gel in suon le hlah a nei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kang peipi nading gam in ang luohkhiet lo nadingin ka thukham zosie le ka biehna ngaina kipte zosie zui-in na tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na masang vua ka delmang ding minamte’ ngainate na zui sih ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile amate in tam na zosie a bawl ziehun amate ka kidah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin na kung vuah kang gen zo hi: A leitang uh na luo ding vua, keima in noma’ nei dingun bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna leitang kang pie ding hi. Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi; mite lah panin note kang khenkhie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ganhing a siengte, ganhing a sieng lote, le va a sieng le a sieng lote na khen ding uhi; note in in nieh hi, ci-in na se ding vua ka koisa ganhing hile va hile leitunga a vah ganhing khatpo tawh hile a kidahhuoi-in na om sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keima adingin na siengtho uhi; bangzieh ahei cile Topa ahi keima ka siengtho a, keima-a’ na hi thei nadingun mite lah panin kang tuomkoi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Numei ahi a, pasal ahi zongin dawilawm nei mi ahi sihle bumtawi mi poma kithat ding hi; suong tawh amate kiseplia ding a, amau’ sisan pen amate tung ma-ah tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi: Aaron’ tapa siempute hopi inlen tam bangin gen in: A unau sanggamte lahah a koima in misi khat po,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a kinaipi pente ahi, a nu, a pa, a tapa, a tanu, a sanggampa-te hang ci simlo ama le ama kibuasah lo ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua ma bangin a sanggam nungah nu hangin ama kibuasah thei ding hi, azieh pen tua nu in pasal a nei lo ziehin ama tawh kinai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin a mite lahah mi khat’ pasal khat bangin ama le ama kibuasah loin kimindaisah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A lutung vuah a behkieu mun a bawl sih ding vua, a khamul mong uzong tantom loin a ci tung vuah liemma themkhat zong a bawl sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A Pasien tung vuah a siengtho ding vua, a Pasien uh’ min a daisah sih ding uhi; azieh pen amate in a Pasien’ uh an ahi mei tawh Topa’ biehna a pie uhi; tua ahi ziehin amate a siengtho ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in numei pahtat ahi sihle numei a buasate a kinunpi thei sih ding uhi; a pasal in a khulsa numei zong a kinunpi sih ding uhi. Azieh pen amau’ Pasien adingin siempute a siengtho uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuale amate in na Pasien uh’ an a pieh ziehun amate a siengtho-in na ngaisun ding uhi; Note ang siengsah pa, Topa ahi keima ka sientho ziehin note dingin amate siengtho ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siempu khatpo’ tanu in a pahtatna tawh ama le ama a kidaisah leh a pa daisah ahi hi; ama nu mei tawh kihaltum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A guolte lah panin a kitawisang, a lu tunga sathau siengtho kibuoh, le a puonte sil dinga a ki-apsa siempu pa in a sam paw loin koi lo ding a, a puonsilte zong ehsah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi siluong opna munah ama pei lo ding hi; a nu ahi sihle a pa luong nangawn tawh ama le ama kibuasah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mun siengtho pulamah pusuoh loin a Pasien’ mun siengtho zong daisah lo ding hi; azieh pen ama tungah Pasien-a’ ahi suhdetna sathau a om hi. Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama pen ngahnu siengtho numei beh tawh kinung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in meigong, ahi sihle a kikhulsa numei, ahi sihle a buasa numei, le a pahtat numei, tam teng tawh kinung lo ding hi. A tanaute lah panin ngahnu siengtho khat tawh kinung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua khu ama in a tanaute lahah ama’ suonlehlahte a daisah lo nading ahi hi; azieh pen ama a siengsah pa keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aaron hopi inlen tam bangin gen in: A khang khanga na suonlehlahte lahah poina a nei mi koima in an pie dingin a Pasien neh thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen poina a nei mittaw ahi sihle khelbai, ahi sihle maihem ahi sihle khut le keng a behsau,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />khut tawng keng tawng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ahi sihle ngumbaw, ahi sihle mitun cing lo, ahi sihle mit hem, ahi sihle cithah vei, ahi sihle hima nei, ahi sihle a cilkeh poma in ei neh thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aaron siempu pa’ suonlehlahte sung panin Topa’ meihal biehna pie dingin a nai-ah koima pei lo ding hi; tua pa pen poina nei ahi ziehin a Pasien’ an pie dingin a nai-ah pei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in a Pasien’ anlum, a siengtho pente le a siengtho nate ne thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in poina a nei ziehin ka mun siengthote a daisah lo nadingin dalna puon ahi sihle maitam lamah pei thei lo ding hi, bang ding ahei cile keima Topa ka hi hi; keima in amate ka siengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua bangin Moses in Aaron le a tapate le Israel mi zosie kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate in ka min siengtho a daisah lo nadingun Israel mite in keima tunga ang pieh a siengtho silpiehte a zatah siem nadingun hil in; keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate kungah tam bangin gen in: Na khang tawntungun na suonlehlahte uh mi khatpo in a sien lo laitahin, Topa tunga Israel mite pieh ahi silpieh siengtho nate a nai leh ka opna panin keima in tua pa ka hemkhie ding hi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aaron’ suonlehlahte lah panin phah natna vei ahi sihle a neitah tuiluong khatpo in ama a sientho masangsie tua a siengtho nate ne thei lo ding hi. Misi a tham zieha a sieng lo poma, a bawtui luon zieha a sieng lo poma,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ama a bua thei nadinga a bawhva ganhing khat a tham poma, ama’ sien lona pen bang bang hi tale,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua bang na khatpo a tham pa pen nitah dongin a sieng lo hi ding a, tui sungah a kipumsil sih leh ama in tua a siengtho nate a ne sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni a tum ciengin ama a sieng hi ding hi; tua zaw ciengin ama in a siengtho nate ne thei ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile ama’ an tuate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in sapul sa ahi sihle gamsate’ pelup sa ne lo ding a, tua tawh ama a sieng lo a kisuohsah sih ding hi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in khielna bawlin mun siengtho a buasah ziehun tua sungah a si lo nadingun ka thuhilte a zui ding uhi. Amate a siengsah pa khu keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A pulam mi in silpieh siengthote ne thei lo ding hi. Siempu pa’ inna om pemtate in hile, a kiguoi tengtate in hile tua silpieh siengthote a ne thei sih ding uh;.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ahi vangin siempu khat in a sum tawh mi khatpo a lei leh tua pa in tuate ne thei ding a, a inn sunga a suoh mite in ama’ an a ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siempupa’ tanu khat in a pulam mi khat a kinunpi leh tua nu in silpieh siengthote ne thei lo ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ahi vangin siempupa’ tanu pen suonlehlah nei loin meigong ahi sihle a kikhul ahi a, a ngahnut lai ma bangin phungkia-in a pa’ inn a zotkia leh tua nu in a pa’ an ne thei ding hi. A pulam mi in tua an ne thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi khat in tupna nei loin silpieh siengtho a neh khah leh ama in a na manza’ senga lahah sekhat belapin, siempu pa tungah silpieh siengtho pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa tunga a pieh uh Israel mite’ silpieh siengthote koima in buasah lo ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tua a siengtho silpiehte nehna ziehin amate in khielna zieha biehna pieh ding kisam za dongin tua khielna a puosah sih ding hi: Azieh pen keima Topa ka hi hi; keima in amate ka siengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate le Israel mi zosie hopi inlen a kung vuah tam bangin gen in: Israel innkuonte lahah hile, Israel gam sunga a teng pemtate lahah hile, mi khatpo in Topa tungah kiciemna ahi sihle nop thu-a biehna ahi meihal biehna a pieh ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuate ang kisanpieh thei nadingin bawngtang hile tuu hile keel hile genbaang lo apa khat na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Genbaang khatpo na pie sih ding uhi. Azieh pen note dingin tuate kisang lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi khatpo in a kiciemna khat ahi sihle nop thu-a a biehna khat a tangtun thei nadingin bawnghon pan hile, tuu le keel hon pan hile Topa tungah thunuoma biehpiehna khat a pieh ciengin a kisan thei nadingin a ganhing pen a bukim hi ding hi; paubaanna om lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa tungah ganhing a mittaw, ahi sihle a liem, ahi sihle a gutawng, ahi sihle hima nai nei, ahi sihle cithah vei ahi sihle hima pawn neite na pie sih ding vua, ahi sihle meihal biehna dingin maitam tungah tuate khatpo na koi sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nopthu-a biehna dingin bawngtang khat ahi sihle a keng tuomsau ahi sihle a keng tuomtom tuu khat na pie thei ding uhi; ahi vangin kiciemna dingin tuate kisang lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa tungah a ciltang liemsa ahi sihle a ciltang kitawkehsa ahi sihle a ki-atkhesa, ahi sihle a kiladawhsa ganhing khatpo na pie sih ding vua, na gam sung vuah tua bangin na bawl sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh tunga an tawh silpieh dingin gamdang mi khatpo kung pana kinga ganhingte na sang sih ding uh;. azieh pen amate genbaangin melsie uh ahi ziehin note dingin tuate kisang lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawng khat ahi sihle tuu khat ahi sihle keel khat a suo ciengin a nu tawh ni sagi sung omton ding a, a ni giet ni panin tua ganno pen Topa kungah mei tawh a kihal biehna dingin kisang thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin bawnghon lah panin hile, tuu le keelhon lah panin hile, api pen a tasen tawh ni khat thu-in na goton sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lungdamkona silpieh ahi biehpiehna na lui ciengun, note tanga ang kisan thei nadingin Topa tungah tua biehpiehna na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khumi ni ma-in tuate kine ding hi; zingmawng dongin khat beh na hen si ding uhi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin ka thupiehte zui-in na tang ding uhi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel mite lahah ei kisiensah thei nadingin ka min siengtho na daisah sih ding uhi: Keima Topa ka hi hi; keima in note ka siengsah hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />na Pasien uh ahi dingin Egypt gam panin ang peipi pa keima ka hi hi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite hopi inlen tam bangin gen in: A siengtho biehpieh kikhopnate ahi hi, ci-in na tangtawh ding uh a kisesa Topa’ pawite tam teng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni guh sungin nasep kizo ding hi; hizongle a ni sagi ni pen a bukim tawlngahna Sabbath, a siengtho biehpieh kikhopna ahi hi; note in na na sem sih ding uhi: tua khu na tenna zosie vuah Topa dinga Sabbath ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam teng pen a kise Topa’ pawite, amate dingin a kise huna na bawlpieh ding uh a siengtho biehpieh kikhopnate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hla masa, tua hla a ni sawm le ni li ni a nitah lamin Topa tungah peisan pawi biehna om ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua hla a ni sawm le ni nga ni pen Topa tungah tol saw lo anlum pawi ahi hi; ni sagi sung tol saw lo anlum na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ni masa ni-in a siengtho biehpieh kikhop khat na nei ding vua, leitung nate na sem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen note in Topa tungah ni sagi sung meihal biehna na pie ding uhi; a ni sagi ni-in siengtho biehpieh kikhop khat om ding hi: note in leitung nate na sem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel mite hopi inlen tam bangin gen in: Keima in na tung vua kang pieh ding gamah lutin bu na at ciengun siempu pa kungah na buphai at masa pen uh na tawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />San thei-a na op nadingun Topa mai-ah ama in tua buphai vei ding a, sabbath zaw a zing ciengin siempu pa in tua buphai a vei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Buphai na vei ni-un Topa tungah meihal biehna dingin tuuno apa khat Topa na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua tawh kipiehtha ding an tawh biehna dingin sathau kisawsa annel ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-seni hi ding hi; tua khu Topa kipie a gimnamtui ding meihal biehna ahi hi; tua tawh a kipiehtha ding dawn thei biehna dingin lenggazu hin khat’ seli-suo- sekhat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na Pasien uh’ biehna na tawi masang uh, tua ni masangin anlum ahi sihle a ki-em an ahi sihle ansielte na ne sih ding uhi: Tua khu na tenna mun vannuoi vuah na khang tawntung vua na zui ding uh ngaina khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sabbath ni zaw ciengin a kivei biehna dingin buphai na tawi ni vua kipanin nipi sagi na simto ding uhi; tuate pen a bih hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sabbath sagina zaw a zing cieng dong ni sawmnga dong na simto ding uhi; tua ciengin Topa kungah an tha tawh biehna na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kivei biehna dingin na tenna uh panin Topa tungah ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-seni tuoh tawh a kibawl anlum ni na tawi ding uhi; tuate pen annel tawh a kibawl, tol tawh ki-em, Topa tungah anpal-a kipie dingte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anlum tawh kum khat a pha, a paubaang lo tuuno sagi, bawngno khat, le tuutang ni na pie ding uhi. Tuate, an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehnate tawh Topa tunga kipiehtha meihal biehna hi ding hi; tuate pen Topa a lungkimsah a gimnamtui mei tawh kihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mawna zieha biehna dingin keel apa khat, le thunuom biehna dingin kum khat a pha tuuno apa ni na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siempu pa in Topa mai-ah tuate a kivei biehna-in anpal anlum le tuuno ni tawh veiton ding hi; siempu pa adingin tuate Topa mai-ah a sieng hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khum ni ma-in note in tang na tawh ding uhi; note in a siengtho biehpieh kikhop khat na nei ding uhi; note in leitung nasepte na khawl ding uh. Tam pen na tenna uh mun vannuoi-ah na khang tawntung vua na zui zing ding uh thukham ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na leitang pan vua an na lah ciengun na lo gei dong uh la loin, na ansanghte uzong na khawm sih ding uhi; tuate pen mizawngte le pemtate na nuasiepieh ding uhi: Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel mite kungah tam bangin gen in: A hla sagi veina, tuami hla masa ni-in a bukim tawlngahna ni khat, pengkul awte tawh phawna a kibawl a siengtho biehpieh kikhop khat na nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Note in leitung nasepte na sem sih ding uhi; mei tawh Topa’ meihal biehna na peipi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tu-in tam a hla sagina a ni sawm ni khu thoidamna ni ahi hi; note adingin a siengtho biehpieh kikhop khat hi ding hi: Noma le noma na kideh ding vua, tuaci’n Topa tungah meihal biehna na pie ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tuami ni bup sung tungtawnin na na sem sih ding uhi; bang ding ahei cile tuami khu Topa na Pasien mai vuah note tanga thoidamna bawl nadingin thoidamna bawl ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tua nibup sung tungtawnin ama le ama kidehna a bawl lo poma a mite lah panin kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuami nibup sung tungtawnin tua banga nasem poma a mite lah panin ka susie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Note in na na sem sih ding uhi: Tuami ni pen na khang tungtawn vua na tenna uh mun zosie-ah zui ding thupieh khat hi zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuami ni pen note dingin a bukim tawlngahna Sabbath ni khat hi ding a, noma le noma na na kideh ding uhi; tua hla a ni kuo nitah panin a nitah kia dong na Sabbath uh na tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Israel mite hopi inlen tam bangin gen in: Tami hla a sagina ni sawm le nga ni panin ni sagi sung, Topa adingin buh pawite om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A ni masa ni pen a siengtho biehpieh kikhop hi ding hi; note in leitung nasepte na sem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ni sagi sung note in mei tawh kihal Topa’ biehna na lui ding uhi; a ni giet ni-in a siengtho biehpieh kikhop khat nei-in Topa’ meihal biehna na lui ding uhi; tua khu a thupi kikhopna khat ahi hi; note in leitung nasepte na sem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tam teng pen a kisesa Topa’ pawite ahi a, a siengtho biehpieh kikhopna hunin tuate na zang ding vua, Topa tungah mei tawh kihal biehnate- meihal biehna, an tawh biehna, thoidamnate le dawn thei biehnate amau’ ni cietin na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tam teng pen Topa’ Sabbath-te, na letsongte uh, na kiciemna zieh vua na biehnate zosie ule kiphalna tawh na biehnate zosie ban vuah na pieh dingte uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tu-in leitanga a piengte na kaikhop zaw uh, a hla sagina ni sawm le ni nga panin ni sagi sung Topa’ pawi na bawl ding uhi. A ni masa ni pen a bukim tawlngahna ni khat hi a, a ni giet ni zong a bukim tawlngahna ma hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A ni masa ni-in a etlawm sing gate, lutu bate, a na pha singbate le luidunga a po gielhehte na la ding uhi; tuale Topa na Pasien uh mai-ah ni sagi sung na guolnuom ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua pen kum simin ni sagi sung Topa’ pawi-in na mang ding uhi; tua khu na khang tungtawn vua a kip den ding thukham hi ding a, tua pen a hla sagina sungin na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Buh sungah ni sagi sung na teng ding uhi; Israel gam sunga tuolsung mi zosie buh sungah teng ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />tuaci’n Egypt gam panin amate ka peipi lai-in buh sunga Israel mite ka tensahna thute na suonlehlahte un a thei ding uhi: Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua bangin Moses in Israel mite tungah Topa’ pawi a kisate a phuongzah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meivah a kuon den thei nadingin olive ga kigawivui sathau siengtho na kungah ang tawi nadingun Israel mite thupie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kikhopna buh sung, thuciemna dalna diel pulamah nitah panin zingmawng dongin Topa mai-ah tua meivah a kuong den dingin Aaron in koi ding hi; tua khu na khang tungtawn vua na zui ding uh thukham hi den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in kham citah tawh kibawl meivah tunna khuom tung Topa mai-ah meivahte koi den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Annel la-in tua panin moh sawm le ni na em ding a, moh khat ciengin annel ephah khat’ sesawm-suo- seni ta hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuate kham citah sabuoi tungah zawn ni-in na koi ding a, zawn khatah guh ta om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Annlum tawh melcina biehna dingin Topa tungah mei tawh kihal biehna a kipieh thei nadingin zawn khat cietah gimnamtui siengtho na koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sabbath ni sielin Aaron in kumtawn thuciemna-in Israel mite tangin tuate a ngaina bangin Topa mai-ah koi den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuate pen Aaron le a tapate nga ding satanh ahi a, amate in mun siengtho khatah ne ding uhi. Azieh pen tuate Topa tunga meihal silpieh lah panin ama’ nga den ding a satanh siengtho pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel mite lah panin a nu Israel-te, a pa Egypt-te ahi mi khat peikhie hi; giephuol sungah Israel numei’ tapa le Israel mi khat kihau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel numei’ tapa in tua gensie-in a samsie hi. Amate in Moses kungah tua pa a peipi uhi. Ama’ nu min pen Shelomith ahi a, Dan minam, Debri’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate tungah Topa’ khensatna a kitel masangin tua mipa a khumcip uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua Pasien’ min gensie pa giephuol pulamah peipi in. Tuale a za tapo in ama’ lu tungah khut ngamin mihon zosie in ama suong tawh sepsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel mite hopi inlen tam bangin gen in: Pasien a samsie poma in ama’ mawna khu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa’ min a gensie mipa kithat ding a, mihon buppi in suong tawh tua a gensie pa sep ding uhi. Pemtate hile tuolsung mite hile tua Min Siengtho a gensiet ciengun amate kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing khat a that poma kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ganhing khat a that poma in tua tangin ditkiana bawl ding a, hinna khat tangin hinna khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Midang khat a poisah mi poma ama bawl bangin ama tungah kithuhkia ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gu pen gu ma tawh, mit pen mit ma tawh, ha pen ha ma tawh kithuh ding hi. Ama in mi khat a liemsah bang ma-in ama kiliemsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ganhing khat a that pa in tua ganhing’ manh lo ding hi; ahi vangin mi that pa kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Note in pemtate ading le tuolsung mite adingin a kibang thukham na nei ding uhi: Bangzieh ahei cile keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tam bangin Moses in Israel mite hopi hi; tuale amate in giephuol pulamah mi samsie pa peipi-in suong tawh a seplia uhi. Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin Israel mite a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Sinai Muol tungah Moses hopi-in tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite hopi inlen a kung vuah tam bangin gen in: Note kang pieh ding leitangah na tun ciengun tua leitang in Topa adingin sabbath tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum guh sung lo na pawi ding vua, kum guh sung na lengguite uh heuhin a ga na khawm ding uh;.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ahi vangin a kum sagina sungin leitang ading a bukim tawlngahna sabbath khat om ding a, Topa ading sabbath hi ding hi. Na lo uh na pawi sih ding vua, na lenggui uzong na heuh sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anlah nua-a ali pote na at sih ding vua, a kiheuh lo na lengguite na khawm sih ding uhi: Tua khu leitang adingin a bukim tawlngahna kum hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua sabbath kum sunga leitang pana a piengte- note, na sila numeite le pasalte, a kiguoi na nasemte ule no tawh a tengton pemtate in na ne thei ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />azieh pen tua na leitang panun a pieng zosie na ganhonte ading zong le na gam sung vua gamsate dingin an hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kum nipi sagi hun pen kum sawmli le kum kuo ahi thei nadingin kum nipi sagi, kum sagi mun sagivei na simto ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin hla sagina a ni sawm ni-in pengkul na gingsah ding uhi; note in hla sagina a ni sawm ni ahi thoidamna ni-in na gam sung zosie vuah pengkul na gingsah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kum sawmngana na siengthosah ding vua, gam sung mun zosie-a teng mi zosie tungah suotahna thu na phuongzah ding uhi. Tua khu note dingin jubilee khat hi ding hi: Na unpi-un na logam ule na inn ciet vuah na kilekia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua kum sawmnga cinna pen note adingin jubilee khat hi ding hi: Lo pawi lo, a lipote la lo, a kiheuh lo lengguite khawm loin na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tua khu jubilee ahi hi; tua khu note dingin siengtho ding hi: Note in gamlah pana a piengte beh na ne ding uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami jubilee kum sungin na neisa uh na logam ciet vuah a koimapo na peikia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na vengte kunga na zua cieng ule na vengte kung pana na lei ciengun khatlekhat na kisol sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jubilee zaw ciengin a kum phaza tawh kituohin na vengte tung panin na lei ciengun a zuate in an pieng ding kum phaza tawh kituohin a manh tan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kum a tam leh a manh sangsahin, a kum a tawm leh a manh na tawmsah ding uhi; azieh pen an pieng ding kum tawh kituohin na tung vua ang kizua ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khatlekhat kisoltuoh loin na Pasien uh na giing zaw ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua leitang tungah lungmuong tahin na ten thei nadingun ka thukhamte zui-in ka biehna ngaina kipte na tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua leitang in an piengsahin gilva tahin an ne-in, a sungah lungmuong tahin na teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note in lo pawi loin an lah at sih mawh leih a kum sagina kum ciengin bang i ne ta ding vuoi? na ci kha thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima in kum thum sung khom ding an a pien thei nadingin a kum guhna kumin note dingin ka thupha kang peisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A kum gietna kumin lo na pawi ciengun anlui na ne ding uhi; antha ang tun nading a kum kuona masang anlui na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leitang keima-a’ ahi ziehin kumtawnin kizuamang thei lo ding hi; note na hi uleh keima tawh a omton pemta le leitang kawmte na hibo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na leitang neina zosie vuah leitang tatkia thei dingin na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na tanaute uh khatpo in a hamsat ziehin a leitang behkhat a zua leh, a tanau a kinaipi pen pa pei-in tua a sanggampa’ zuasa leitang tankia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua mipa in a tan ding koima a nei sih a, hizongle ama ang citheikia ciengin a tat nading sum a kicingin ang mukia leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a leitang a zua ni panin a kum phaza kisimin, a zuana pa kungah a piehbe ding teng lekia ding a, tuaci’n a neisate kipiekia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuate a ngakia thei nadingin sum a kicinga a nei sih leh, tua a vanzua pen a leipa kungah jubilee dong om ding hi; Jubilee hun ciengin kipiekia-in tua neisa kilekia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi khatpo in khuo kulpi sungah tenna inn khat a zua leh, a zua huna kipanin kum khat a cin zaw ciengin tankia thei ding hi; tatkia theina ding hun pen kum khat sung hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kum khatbih a cin zaw masangin tua inn a kitat zawh sih leh, tua khuo kulpi sunga om inn pen a khan tawntunga a nei den dingin a leipa kungah kipie ding hi; Jubilee ciengin tuate kipiekia lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin kul a nei lo a kimvela khuota innte ahileh, gamlaha lote tawh kibangin kiciemte ding hi; tuate kitanthei kia-in jubilee hun sungin kipiekia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Levi-te’ nei khuopite tungtang thu-ah, Levi-te in tua khuopite sunga a nei uh innte a tawntungin tatkia theina thu nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Levi-te tung panin tua bang neisate-khuopi khat sunga a nei uh a kizuasa innte kitankia thei ding a- jubilee hun sungin kipekia ding hi; azieh pen Levi-te’ khuopite sunga innte pen Israel mite lahah amate’ neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin a khuopi uh kim gamlaha lote pen kizua thei lo ding hi; azieh pen tuate amau’ nei den ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hamsatna ziehin na tanau khatpo un note ang bel leh amate na va ding uhi; amate pen note tawh khuolmi pemta bangin teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate tung panin a met la masa sih unlen, tua ahi sihle a met a khang la loin na Pasien ging zaw un; amate, note lahah tengsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate tungah na sum uh a metin palahsah loin, a metin na an uzong na pie sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kei pen na Pasien uh ahi ding le note’ tunga Canaan leitang ang pie dingin Egypt pan ang peipi Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />No ang belte lahah mite in a zawn ziehin na tung vua ang kizua uleh, silate bangin amate na bawl sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amate pen a kiciel nasemte ahi sihle a kihen nasemte bangin note tawh omden ding uhi. Jubilee kum masangin amate in na na uh a sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua ciengin na khut sung panun a tate utawh amate a suohta ding uhi; a inn uh lam zuonin a peikia ding vua, a pu a pa’ gamah a kilekia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Azieh pen Egypt gam pana ka peipi amate pen keima’ nasemte ahi uhi; silate kizua bangin amate kizua lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Pauhat thu tawh amate na uh sih ding vua, na Pasien uh na giingzaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Note’ nei thei ding sila numeite le sila pasalte tam bang ahi hi: Na kimvel vua a om minamte lah panin sila numeite le sila pasalte na lei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Note tawh a tengton pemtate lah pan le na gam sung vua a suoh note tawh a tengton amau’ innkuon lah panin na lei thei ding uhi; amate pen na neisa uh a suoh thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Na nua cieng vua na tate uh’ nei le luo dingin amate na koi thei ding uhi. Silate bangin amate na bawl thei ding vua, ahi vangin na sanggamte uh Israel-te ahile, mi koima in adang khat tungah ngongtatna tawh uh lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Note lahah khuolmi pemta khat ang cithei a, na tanaute un hamsatna tuohin tua pemta pa kungah amau le amau a kizua vua, ahi sihle tua pemta pa’ innkuon khatpo tungah a kizua uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />amau le amau a kizua zawciengun a kitatkia theina ding thu nei ding uhi; amau’ sanggamte khatpo in amate tankia thei ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />ahi sihle amau’ pano ahi sihle amau’ pano’ tapa amate tankia thei ding a, ahi sihle amau’ innkuon sunga si le sa-a a kinaipi uh khatpo in amate tan thei ding hi; ahi sihle a cithei vua ahile amau le amau zong kitan thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tua pemta pa tunga amate a kizua kum panin jubilee kum dong a kum teng zosie a unpi-in a leipa tawh tuot ding uhi; a kizua manh pen a kum phaza tawh kituot ding hi: A neipa tawh a omton hun sung teng pen a kiciel nasem khat’ thaman tawh a kikimin kise ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kum tampi a sap lai leh a kileina manh tawh kituohin amau’ kitatna pie ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />tuale Jubilee kum masang kum tawmno in a sap lai leh tam bangin tuot ding uhi: Amate in nasep kum kisam dung zui-in amau’ kitat manh pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Amate pen a kumkumin a kicieltawm nasem khat bangin tua pa’ thuneina sungah a om ding vua, ahi zongin ama in note’ muna-ah amate gamtahin uh lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tam dan teng lahah khat penpen tawh amate a kitat sih leh, Jubilee hun ciengin amate le a ompi a tate utawh a suohta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Israel mite pen kei adingin ka nasemte ahi uhi; amate pen keima in Egypt leitang pana ka peitopi ka nasemte ahi uhi: Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noma adingin milimte na bawl sih ding vua, a kikhuoh milimte hile biehna songte hile phut loin na bieh dingun na gam sung vuah suong milimte na koi sih ding uhi; azieh pen keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Sabbath-te na tang ding vua, ka mun siengtho zong na zatah ding uhi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thukhamte zui-in ka thupiehte na man vua, citah tahin tuate na tan uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />na tung vuah a hunin guotuite kang pie ding a, leitang in ga ga-in lolai-a kungte zong a ga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bucil hun le lengga law hun kiphamat ding a, lengga law hun le lopawi hun kizom ding hi; gilva tahin an na ne ding vua, na gam sung vuah lungnuom tahin na teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na gam sung vuah nopsahna hing pie-in lungmuong tahin na lum ding vua, koima in ang zausah sih ding uhi; keima in gam sung panin gamsa gilote ka delmang ding a, namsau in na gam uh ang nawh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na galte na delgam ding vua, na masang vuah namsau tawh amate a pua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi nga in mi zakhat delin mi zakhat in na galte tul sawm na del ding uhi; na mai vuah na galte namsau tawh a pua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in note kang angvan ding a, zong hing pungsahin tampi kang phasah ding hi; note tawh ka kiciemna ka tukip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anlui a kikholte na ne ding vua, antha khol nadingin anluite na hemsieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima in na laikim vuah ka tenna mun ka koi ding a, note kang kidah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note lahah hing pei-in na Pasien uh ka hi ding a, note zong ka mite na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amau’ sila na hi nawn lo nadingun Egypt gam panin note ang peipi Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi; keima in na hahkolte uh ka hliehtawng zo a, a dingtangin lam kang peisah zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka thu mang loin ka thupiehnate zosie na zui sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ka thukhamte ngielin ka biehna ngaina kipte na huot vua, ka thupiehnate zosie zui loin ka thuciemna na suhsiet uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />na tung vuah keima in tam bangin kang bawl ding hi: Keima in note tungah zauna, a dam thei lo natna le hinna a lamang thei cisa natna kang tungsah ding hi. Na galte in tuate netum ding uh ahi ziehin lo na pawi vangun a mawhna hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima in note kang maisiet ding a, na galte in ang zo gawp ding uhi; na galte in ang uh ding vua, koima del lopi-in na sitai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua za dongin thuoh napi-in ka thu na ngai nai vaset sih uleh na mawnate uh ziehin a za sagi vei-in dan kang pie lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note’ kiletsahpi na vanglietnate uh keima in ka hiatawng ding a, na vantung uh sia bangsahin na leitang uh sumsan ka bangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na thatang uh a mawhna-in kizang ding hi: Na leitang un an piengsah loin na gam sung vua singkungte ga lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima nei langbawl lailai vua, ka thu na man sih uleh na mawnate uh ziehin na tung vuah a za sagi vei-in gimna kang tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Note lahah gamsa gilote hing hla-in na tate uh ang tawmang ding a, na ganhonte uzong ang susie ding hi; amate in note mi tawmno khat ang suohsah ding a, tuaci’n na lampite uh gamkhing a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tam banga gimna na thuohna utawh kei lam nang kingat nai sih vua kei nei langbawl lai vaset uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ken zong tam bangin note kang langbawl lai ding hi: Kei mama in na mawnate uh ziehin note a za sagi vei-in kang sat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuciemna phu la dingin na langkhat vuah namsau kang tungsah ding hi; na khuopite sung vua na nuakia uleh na lah vuah natna kang tungsah ding a, na galte uh’ khut sungah ang kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Note’ hinna an ka suhsietpieh ciengin numei sawm in lungthu khatah na anlum uh a em ding vua, amate in na anlumte uh tawite-in themkhat ta behin a hawm ding uhi; na ne ding vua, ahi vangin na kham sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hizongle tua bang pima tawh ka thu ngaituon loin nei langbawl lai vaset uleh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ken zong thangpaina tawh note kang langbawl lai ding hi; kei mama in na mawnate uh ziehin a za sagi vei-in dan kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Note in na tanute ule a tapate uh’ sa na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Keima in na munsangte uh susie-in na gimnamtui halna uh ahi maitamte ka phua ding hi; noma’ milim’ siluong hawmte tungah na luonghawmte uh ka seng ding hi. Keima in note kang kidah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Keima in na khuopite uh siesahin na mun siengthote uh gamkhing ka suohsah ding a, na gim namtuite uh ka dih sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leitang ka siesah ding a, tuaci’n tua tunga a teng na galte un lamdang a sa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Minamte lahah kang thezah ding a, note tawh kido nadingin namsau a pai panin ka dawh ding hi; na leitang uh gamkhing suoh ding a, na khuopite uzong hawmsuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin na galte uh’ leitangah na om sung uh, gamkhinga a kinuasie laisie, leitang in a sabbath kumte tangin nuom a sa ding hi; tua ciengin tua leitang tawlnga-in a sabbath kumte tangin nuom a sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Leitang in a gamkhinga a op sungin, ama tunga note na ten lai vua a nga khah lo tawlngahna sabbath-te nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Keima in note sung panin a galte uh’ leitangah a hinglaite tungah lungsim gimna ka tungsah ding hi; hui in a mut nathel gin khat in amate ka taisah ding a, mi khat namsau masanga a tai bangin amate tai-in koima del loin a puamat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Koima del lopi-in namsau mai pan a suotah nadinga a kitai bangin khatlekhat na kipalpua ding uhi; tuale note in na galte nan zawh nadingin vanglietna na nei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Minamte lahah na mangthai ding vua, na galte uh’ leitang in ang valtum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Note sung panin a galte leitanga a omlaite amau’ khielnate ziehin a thazawm ding uhi; a pu a pate’ khielna ziehin amate zong thazawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima langkhatah amate a zuou gamtat vua, tua tham loin kei ei lang bawl vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />tuaci’n ken zong lang bawlin a galte uh’ leitangah amate ka peipi hi; tua ciengin tep tan lo amau’ lungsimte kiniemkhiehin a khielnate ziehun amate a kipuophat uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />keima in Jacob tawh ka thuciemna ka phawhkia ding hi; keima in Isaac tawh ka thuciemna le Abraham tawh ka thuciemnate zong phawhkia-in tua leitang zong ka phawhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate in leitang a nuasie ding vua, amate om loin gamkhing ahi sung tengin leitang in a sabbath kumte tangin nuom a sa ding hi. Amate in ka biehna ngaina kipte niel ngamin ka thukhamte a huot ziehun a mawna uh a kipuopha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hizongle tuate zosie ziehin a galte uh’ gam sunga a op ciengun amate ka nuol sih ding a, ahi sihle amate tawh ka thuciemna a pelh za dingin amate ka pumhuot sih ding hi; azieh pen keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate ka angvan ziehin amate’ Pasien ahi dingin keima in Egypt gam panin minamte’ muna-ah ka peipi a pu a pate utawh ka thuciemna ka phawh ding hi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tam teng pen Sinai Muol tungah Moses tungtawna Topa in ama le Israel mite kikala a bawl thukipte, biehna ngaina kipte le thukhamte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses hopi-in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite hopi inlen amate kungah tam bangin gen in: Mi khat in mihing khat’ manhza tawh kikim thu tawh kisai Topa tungah a tuom vilvelin kiciemna a bawl ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />pasal khat’ kikimpi a manh pen tam bang hi ding hi: Kum sawmni panin kum sawmguh a phate’ kikimpi amanh dingin mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in ngun shekel sawmnga hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Numei ahile a kikimpi amanh dingin shekel sawmthum hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kum nga panin kum sawmni cieng a pha pasal khat ahile pasal’ kikimpi amanh dingin shekel sawmni hi ding a, numei’ kikimpi amanh dingin shekel sawm hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hla khat pan kum nga cieng a pha, pasal khat’ kikimpi amanh dingin ngun shekel nga hi ding a, numei khat’ kikimpi amanh dingin ngun shekel thum hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi khat kum sawmguh le a tungsie ahile pasal khat’ kikimpi amanh dingin shekel sawm le nga hi ding a, numei adingin shekel sawm hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi khatpo in tua a kikimpi za a piehzawh sih leh siempu pa kungah amate kipeipi ding a, siempu pa in amate’ manh phaza ding tanpieh ding hi; siempu pa in a kiciem mi khatpo’ pieh zawh za ciet tawh kizui-in amanh tan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa tungah biehna-in kitawi thei ganhing tawh kisai ahile Topa tungah tua banga a kipie na khatpopo a siengtho ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ganhing tangin adang khat tawh kihleng lo ding a, a hoite a hoilote tawh, a hoilote a hoite tawh kihleng lo ding hi. Ganhing khat adang khat tawh na hlen leh, tua ganhing le na hlenna ganhing tegel a nituohin siengtho ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa tungah biehna-in a kitawi thei lo ganhing sieng lo khat tawh kisai ahile siempu pa’ mai-ah tua ganhing kipeipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siempu pa in a hoi le a hoi lo tawh kizui-in amanh za se ding hi: Siempu pa se bang bang amanh hi pai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua ganhing a kitankia ding ahile a kisesa amanh’ senga- suo-sekhat kibelap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi khat po in Topa’ kungah a inn khat a siengtho dingin a ap leh, siempu pa in tua inn a hoi le a hoi lo tawh kizui-in amanh se ding hi: Siempu pa se bangin kip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A inn ap pa in a tat nuomkia leh amanh kitansa’ se nga-suo-sekhat piehbe ding a, tuaci’n a inn tangkia thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi khat in Topa tungah a gamhluo leitang beh khat a ap leh amanh ciengtan dan ding pen khaici pieng ding tawh kizui-in kise ding hi: Mangbuham homer khat kipawitheina leitang pen ngun shekel sawmnga hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua mipa in jubilee kum kipatin a logam a ap leh amanh kisena zaza kip ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ahi vangin tua lo pen jubilee zaw cienga ki-ap ahile siempu pa in jubilee kumkia dong a omlai kumte tawh kituohin tua logam’ manh tuot ding a, jubilee kum tunkia nadinga a kisam lai kumte tawh kizui-in tuot ding a, a kum tawh kizui ma-in amanh khiem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuami lo a ap pa in ama’ piehsa lo a tat nuomkia leh amanh kitanza’ senga-suo -sekhat piehbe ding a, tuaci’n a nei masa pa kungah tua lo tungkia ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ahi vangin tua lo a kitatkia sih a, ahi sihle midang khat kunga kizuasa ahile kitankia thei nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin jubilee hun sungin tua lo a kipieh ciengin Topa tunga ki-apsa lo bangin a siengtho hi ding hi; tua khu siempupa-a’ hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi khat in a gamhluo logam ahi lo, a leisa logam khat Topa tunga a ap leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />siempu pa in jubilee kum dong tawh kituohin tua logam’ manh za ding tuot ding a, tua ni-a kipanin Topa tungah a manh kiseza pen a siengtho silpiehin a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jubilee kum sungin tua logam pen a kileina logam neipa tungah kilekia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Van manh sena zosie mun siengtho shekel tawh kizui-in kise ding hi: Gerah sawmni ciengin shekel khat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin ganno tacilte Topa- a’ ahi ziehin koima in ap thei lo ding a, bawng ahi a, keel ahi zongin tuate Topa -a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuate pen ganhing sieng lo ahile amanh kise za’ senga-suo- sekhat tungdipin kitanh ding hi; a kitat sih leh amanh kisena bangin kizua ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi khat in a nei, Topa tunga suhsiet dinga ki-apsate, mihing hitale ganhing hitale, gamhluo logamte hitale, kizua thei lo ding a, zong kitankia thei lo ding hi; a ki-ap na zosie pen Topa adingin sil siengtho pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Suhsiet dinga ki-apsa mite kitankia thei lo ding hi; amate kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Leitang pana pieng sawm-ah-khat zosie khaici ahi a, singga ahi zongin Topa -a’ ahi hi; tuate pen Topa adingin siengtho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amau’ sawm-ah-khat a tanhkia nuomte in amanhza’ senga-suo-sekhat tungdip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bawnghonte le tuuhonte panin sawm-ah-khat zosie le tuucingpa’ ciengkhut nei-a pei ganhing zosie’ sawm-ah-khat poma Topa adingin a siengtho hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Koima in tuate hoi hi, hoi lo hi, ci-in ahi zongin, ahi sihle adang khat tawh hlen dingin ahi zongin kantel thei lo ding a, zong hleng thei lo ding hi; mi khat in tua khu a hlen leh ama’ hlen pen le a hlenna ganhing a nituohin a sieng hi ding a, kitankia thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tam teng pen Sinai Muol tunga om Israel mite adingin Topa in Moses tunga a hil thupiehte ahi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
